b.com/users/navinkarkera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/navinkarkera","id":10894099,"login":"navinkarkera","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk0MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adity-verma/CourseBot-FE-release-teak2/commits/79f865b328aeca14623d54bc59a1c37648b47d6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-08T15:15:44Z","email":"navin@opencraft.com","name":"Navin Karkera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-08T15:15:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: UX issues in unit page (#1913) (#1923)\n\nFixes the following issues:\n\n* Selection behavior\n* Component selection is by header click only\n* Newly created blocks within a unit should be selected on creation/save, appear selected, and have their sidebar open\n* Some long text components seem to display at the default height rather than a longer height\n* Within the full-page unit view, the \"add to collection\" overflow menu item on components does not seem to work/only opens the sidebar.\n* Draft status indicator text is not vertically centered with icon\n* When reordering, dragging a short component past a long component often causes a strange stutter effect.\n* When dragging to reorder a component, moving quickly or scrolling often causes the drag handle to be lost / causes the block to jump somewhere else\n* Reordering may not consistently support a keyboard-accessible option to change order, like in course authoring\n* Tag button on component header opens the old tag side pane\n\n(cherry picked from commit 8c3fab37922fd6ff03a0fa32917b8ac66dd199d1)","tree":{"sha":"442c99e4055b1cff5eac7634a72f6f3808f2d864","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adity-verma/CourseBot-FE-release-teak2/git/trees/442c99e4055b1cff5eac7634a72f6f3808f2d864"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adity-verma/CourseBot-FE-release-teak2/git/commits/79f865b328aeca14623d54bc59a1c37648b47d6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 442c99e4055b1cff5eac7634a72f6f3808f2d864\nparent d5e36cf2b8f100e86869c07fcdf488d7bf181a4b\nauthor Navin Karkera <navin@opencraft.com> 1746717344 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1746717344 -0500\n\nfix: UX issues in unit page (#1913) (#1923)\n\nFixes the following issues:\n\n* Selection behavior\n* Component selection is by header click only\n* Newly created blocks within a unit should be selected on creation/save, appear selected, and have their sidebar open\n* Some long text components seem to display at the default height rather than a longer height\n* Within the full-page unit view, the \"add to collection\" overflow menu item on components does not seem to work/only opens the sidebar.\n* Draft status indicator text is not vertically centered with icon\n* When reordering, dragging a short component past a long component often causes a strange stutter effect.\n* When dragging to reorder a component, moving quickly or scrolling often causes the drag handle to be lost / causes the block to jump somewhere else\n* Reordering may not consistently support a keyboard-accessible option to change order, like in course authoring\n* Tag button on component header opens the old tag side pane\n\n(cherry picked from commit 8c3fab37922fd6ff03a0fa32917b8ac66dd199d1)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PG