":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/regisb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buiducthang652/frontend-component-header/commits/8ef3a27a62128039331e57926268aac199c29114/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-04-02T10:48:48Z","email":"regis@behmo.com","name":"Régis Behmo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-04-14T14:03:03Z","email":"arbrandes@arbrand.es","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"message":"chore: remove husky 🪓🐶\n\nWe remove husky, which is triggering pre-push git hooks, including\nrunning \"npm lint\". This is causing failures when building Docker\nimages, because \"npm clean-install --omit=dev\" automatically triggers \"npm\nprepare\", which attemps to run \"husky\". But husky is not listed in the\nbuild dependencies, only in devDependencies. As a consequence, package\ninstallation is failing with the following error:\n\n        14.13 > @edx/frontend-app-ora-grading@0.0.1 prepare\n        14.13 > husky install\n        14.13\n        14.15 sh: 1: husky: not found\n\nSimilar to: https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-learning/pull/1622","tree":{"sha":"9a2459a0ccd1eae8e2c8aca381170227bb5bd776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buiducthang652/frontend-component-header/git/trees/9a2459a0ccd1eae8e2c8aca381170227bb5bd776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/buiducthang652/frontend-component-header/git/commits/8ef3a27a62128039331e57926268aac199c29114","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https: