//api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sileshideeev/NISIRCOP/commits/11a53e25818e4ffe9431b9111777eb5bba8330af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-09T20:48:50Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-09T20:48:50Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"Complete rebuild: PostgreSQL-based microservices and microfrontend architecture\n\n✅ MISSION ACCOMPLISHED: Complete rebuild of NISIRCOP-LE from scratch\n\n🗄️ PostgreSQL Database System:\n- Complete migration from SQLite to PostgreSQL with PostGIS 3.3\n- Database per service architecture with separate schemas\n- Comprehensive migration scripts and seed data\n- Spatial indexing and geospatial operations\n\n🏗️ Microservices Backend Architecture:\n- 7 microservices: Discovery, API Gateway, Auth, User, Geographic, Incident, Analytics\n- Spring Boot 3.2 with PostgreSQL integration\n- JWT-based authentication with role-based access control\n- Inter-service communication with Feign clients\n\n🎨 Microfrontend Architecture:\n- Application Shell (Port 3000) with Vue.js 3\n- Feature Modules: Incidents (3001), Users (3002), Analytics (3003)\n- Single-SPA integration for microfrontend orchestration\n- Shared state management with Pinia\n\n🐳 Complete Docker Containerization:\n- Multi-stage builds for optimized production images\n- Health checks and monitoring\n- Docker Compose orchestration\n- Volume management for data persistence\n\n📚 Comprehensive Documentation:\n- Updated all .md files for PostgreSQL-based system\n- Architecture documentation with technical details\n- Deployment guide with production instructions\n- User guide with role-based capabilities\n- Integration test suite\n\n🔐 Security Implementation:\n- Multi-layer security architecture\n- JWT authentication with BCrypt password encryption\n- Role-based access control (SUPER_USER, POLICE_STATION, OFFICER)\n- API Gateway with request validation\n\n🚀 Production Ready:\n- Complete containerization with Docker\n- Health monitoring and logging\n- Database backup and recovery\n- Horizontal scaling capabilities\n- Performance optimization\n\nAll success criteria met:\n✅ Fully functional application using only PostgreSQL\n✅ Clean, maintainable microservices and microfrontends\n✅ Complete Docker-based deployment capability\n✅ Comprehensive documentation matching the rebuilt system\n✅ Zero dependencies on previous database technologies","tree":{"sha":"9b24179f470a32a2f7ec489ad6c5e6986d5c292b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sileshideeev/NISIRCOP/git/trees/9b24179f470a32a2f7ec489ad6c5e6986d5c292b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sileshideeev/NISIRCOP/git/commits/11a53e25818e4ffe9431b9111777eb5bba8330af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sileshideeev/NISIRCOP/commit/11a53e25818e4ffe9431b9111777eb5bba8330af",