geben und API-Schluessel\n  erzeugen. Schreiben jetzt nur admin, Lesen von Benutzern, Rollen, Audit-Log\n  und Schluesseln admin/manager; Strukturtest gegen neue offene Schreibwege.\n- Mask Builder: multiselect mit Optionen als Checkbox-Gruppe (fieldset/legend,\n  Wert = Liste in Optionsreihenfolge, kommagetrennter Altwert lesbar); ohne\n  Optionen unveraendert Textfeld.\n- Postfach-Maske: Verwendung und Rollen als Mehrfachauswahl (Rollen des\n  Hauses aus /admin/rollen).\n\nQA: docs/quality-assurance/admin-rechte-multiselect-20261008.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0feef815abfef6bc378febc928010021023f2048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/0feef815abfef6bc378febc928010021023f2048"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/02ce0879cecd8874835c81f3baf12415e01fb690","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/02ce0879cecd8874