2?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/843a54517c77317ea894e34eeac967648cb00393/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:07:42Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T07:07:42Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"message":"feat(mail): Postfaecher je Mandant mit IONOS, Google und Freigaben; Zugangsdaten verschluesselt\n\n- Beliebig viele Postfaecher je Mandant (info@, dispo@, fibu@, zentrale@,\n  persoenlich): IONOS- und Google-Vorlage (App-Passwort oder Google-Anmeldung\n  mit OAuth2/XOAUTH2), allgemeines SMTP, Alias (\"Senden als\").\n- Verwendung je Postfach (einkauf, fibu, dispo, newsletter ...) und Freigabe je\n  Rolle/Benutzer; persoenliche Postfaecher nur fuer den Inhaber. Bestellmails\n  gehen ueber das Einkaufs-Postfach, Newsletter ueber das Newsletter-Postfach.\n- Geheimnisse AES-256-GCM, an Mandant und Zweck gebunden (VALEO_SECRET_KEY);\n  ohne Schluessel wird nichts gespeichert, die DB verbietet Klartext.\n- Maske admin/postfaecher ueber Screen Definition und Mask Builder; neuer\n  Feldtyp \"password\" im Mask Builder.\n- Mit behoben: IMAP-Passwort und STT-Schluessel des CRM-Connectors lagen im\n  Klartext; dessen Admin-Wege hatten keine Rollenpruefung.\n\nMigration mailkonto_mandant_20261008. 31 neue Vertraege + 4 Vitest,\n1171/263 Regressionstests gruen, gitleaks ohne Fund.\nQA: docs/quality-assurance/mailkonto-mandant-20261008.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a3aba4dce6727c7b2b3ded81ff5f7654d7017d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/6a3aba4dce6727c7b2b3ded81ff5f7654d7017d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/843a54517c77317ea894e34eeac967648cb00393","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/843a54517c77317ea894e34eeac967648cb00393","node_id":"C_kwDOP_xA6NoAKDg0M2E1NDUxN2M3NzMxN2VhODk0ZTM0ZWVhYzk2NzY0OGNiMDAzOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/b47cd87be52121cb019e73d929969f25aa3997