e Artikel um; Ist-Aggregation und WhatsApp-Abgleich\n  lasen alle Mandanten; Aufloeser bevorzugen den eigenen Artikel.\n- _list_docs ohne Rueckfall in den Prozessspeicher.\n\n12 neue Vertraege, 1090 Regressionstests gruen, Live-Probe am gewachsenen\nBestand. QA: docs/quality-assurance/restbefunde-bestandsbuch-20261008.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5b0559c85b3772caad438baa7eeecdeeb471a98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/a5b0559c85b3772caad438baa7eeecdeeb471a98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/83a32d91f4ce76a97a86b733995f4c056ceefd88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/83a32d91f4ce76a97a86b733995f4c056ceefd88","node_id":"C_kwDOP_xA6NoAKDgzYTMyZDkxZjRjZTc2YTk3YTg2YjczMzk5NWY0YzA1NmNlZWZkODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/25c623687bffd68811cac9724d2b20e