eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/28e6133eda765025b589a9fecf09abf38d4b9f97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:37:18Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:37:18Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"message":"feat(einkauf): Wareneingang aus dem Anlieferavis; Angebot wird kanonische Bestellung\n\nWareneingang am Avis war nach dem Ruecklauf der vorgetaeuschten Aktion eine\nbenannte Luecke; der vorhandene WE-Dienst buchte gegen eine Stummel-Tabelle\nohne Bestellnummer und ohne Lagerzugang.\n\n* wareneingang_avis_service: Avis -> kanonische Bestellung (bestell_nr), je\n  offene Position Liefermenge fortgeschrieben und Lagerzugang \"einlagerung\"\n  im Bestandsbuch und am Artikel, Bestellung \"geliefert\", Avis \"ERHALTEN\" -\n  ein Commit. Abgelehnt: fremdes Avis/Lager, kein Bestellbezug, nichts offen,\n  Position ohne Artikel (dann wird nichts gebucht).\n* Maske einkauf/anlieferavis: Lieferschein-Nr. und Lager als inputFields\n  (Lager per optionsSource); Aktion delegiert an den Dienst.\n* Lagerliste: Mandant aus dem Kontext statt Query/Standardmandant - als\n  Auswahl haette sie fremde Lager angeboten.\n* Angebot -> Bestellung legt jetzt in domain_einkauf.bestellungen an (dort\n  liest die Bestellungs-Maske), mit Lieferant, Angebotsbezug und offenen\n  Mengen; vorher im Dokumentspeicher, den die Maske nicht kennt. Ein Angebot\n  ohne Lieferanten des Mandanten wird nicht bestellt.\n\n10 + 13 Vertraege gegen valeo_probe, 1543 Tests der Bereiche gruen,\nRatschen gruen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52f2fe9f458868067adf360021a51890a4c32a14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/52f2fe9f458868067adf360021a51890a4c32a14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/28e6133eda765025b589a9fecf09abf38d4b9f97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/28e6133eda765025b589a9fecf09abf38d4b9f97","node_id":"C_kwDOP_xA6NoAKDI4ZTYxMzNlZGE3NjUwMjViNTg5YTlmZWNmMDlhYmYzOGQ0YjlmOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/c466af7def028a2a31f3490c8dfb93af8d2c930d","sha":"c466af7def028a2a31f3490c8dfb93af8d2c930d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/c466af7def028a2a31f3490c8dfb93af8d2c930d"}],"sha":"28e6133eda765025b589a9fecf09abf38d4b9f97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/28e6133eda765025b5