e245525c24bfdc11b4793553f55093da","node_id":"C_kwDOP_xA6NoAKDhiYmVkOGE4ZTI0NTUyNWMyNGJmZGMxMWI0NzkzNTUzZjU1MDkzZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/54a6596991d8fcc6a561b45d567fbd04240a04f2","sha":"54a6596991d8fcc6a561b45d567fbd04240a04f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/54a6596991d8fcc6a561b45d567fbd04240a04f2"}],"sha":"8bbed8a8e245525c24bfdc11b4793553f55093da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/8bbed8a8e245525c24bfdc11b4793553f55093da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/54a6596991d8fcc6a561b45d567fbd04240a04f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:23:31Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:23:31Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"message":"feat(mask-builder): Aktionen deklarieren ihre Eingaben; Opportunity-Aktivitaet aus der Maske\n\nDie native Laufzeit konnte fuer eine Aktion keine Eingaben einsammeln\n(inputFlow war Dokumentation). Aktionen, die etwas wissen muessen, wurden\ndeshalb vorgetaeuscht oder als Luecke gefuehrt.\n\n* ScreenActionDefinition.inputFields (+ optionsSource fuer Auswahlen aus einem\n  Endpunkt): deklarativ in der Screen Definition.\n* ActionInputDialog (mask-builder/renderers): zeichnet die Felder mit\n  FieldRenderer, prueft mit useUniversalFormState; UniversalNativeDetailPage\n  fragt vor Bestaetigung/Vorschau/Ausfuehrung und gibt die Werte in die\n  Nutzlast des commandEndpoint. Keine handgebaute Maske.\n* Governance: inputFields nur mit commandEndpoint, Feldtypen und\n  optionsSource geprueft.\n* crm/opportunity create_activity: Betreff/Typ/Notiz als inputFields,\n  Maskenaktion delegiert an den mandantengebundenen Fachweg. Aus der\n  Lueckenliste gestrichen.\n\n8 Vitest, 829 Backend-Tests gruen (inkl. Maskenaktion gegen valeo_probe).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2882ce96a0d1e92553dc486c7a6d8ef104643d9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/2882ce96a0d1e92553dc486c7a6d8ef104643d9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/54a6596991d8fcc6a561b45d567fbd04240a04f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":