s://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/42f8fe6c3079b6cb3621e14aaa84d791ebfa0404/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:36:01Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:36:01Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"message":"fix(finance): Zahlungslaeufe und Eingangsrechnungen mandantengebunden, Vier-Augen\n\nBefund 1 - Zahlungslaeufe: Alle acht Wege nahmen den Mandanten aus\nQuery(\"system\") (/plan aus dem Rumpf); das Frontend schickte nie einen mit, die\nOberflaeche lief auf \"system\". Jetzt Mandant aus get_tenant_id, Rollen vor der\nDatenbank (FINANCE_LESEN/BEARBEITEN/ADMIN, Freigabe/Ausfuehrung nur ADMIN),\ncreated_by beim Anlegen, Vier-Augen bei der Freigabe, Freigeber = angemeldeter\nNutzer statt approved_by aus dem Rumpf.\n\nBefund 2 - Eingangsrechnungen: Das ganze Modul arbeitete ohne Mandant, Buchen\nschrieb Journal und OP mit dem Mandanten aus dem Dokument. Jetzt tenantId im\nDokument, fremd und mandantenlos = 404, Anlegen ueberschreibt keine vorhandene\nNummer (409), Liste gefiltert, Rollen. Freigabe-Workflow: Rollen, Freigeber =\nangemeldeter Nutzer (eine Person erfuellte eine Zwei-Stufen-Freigabe mit zwei\nNamen). Mitbehoben: Workflow-SQL gegen Spalten, die in keiner DB existieren\n(approval_request_id/approved_at), json.loads auf JSONB (Regel anlegen = 500).\n\nMigration mandant_finanz_crm_20261007 (payment_runs.created_by,\nactivities.opportunity_id fuer Befund 3). 265 Tests gruen, Ratschen gruen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"59b84108c01c8773670601b51d7656fa382e0eec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/59b84108c01c8773670601b51d7656fa382e0eec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/42f8fe6c3079b6cb3621e14aaa84d791ebfa0404","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/42f8fe6c3079b6cb3621e14aaa84d791ebfa0404","node_id":"C_kwDOP_xA6NoAKDQyZjhmZTZjMzA3OWI2Y2IzNjIxZTE0YWFhODRkNzkxZWJmYTA0MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/3e7142c48c6eb85fd22712e8782b3add2f500eaf","sha":"3e7142c48c6eb85fd22712e8782b3add2f500eaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/3e7142c48c6eb85fd22712e8782b3add2f500eaf"}],"sha":"42f8fe6c3079b6cb3621e14aaa84d791ebfa0404","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/42f8fe6c3079b6cb3621e14aaa84d791ebfa0404"},{"au