api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/af2b90facfc421f323ccb92b35875bd0a17b8bad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:13:44Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:13:44Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"message":"fix(masks): Mask-Aktionen melden nur Erfolg, wenn etwas geschehen ist\n\nZwoelf Mask-Aktionen bauten ein Ergebnis-Dict, schrieben Audit und Outbox und\nantworteten success: true - ohne fachliche Wirkung. finance.payment_run.approved\nspeiste die Projektion payment_run_cockpit: ein nicht freigegebener Zahlungslauf\nerschien im Lesemodell als freigegeben.\n\n* run_delegated_mask_action: Pruefung gegen die DB in jedem Modus (Trockenlauf\n  meldet, was der Fachweg ablehnen wuerde), Mutation + Audit + Ereignis in einem\n  Commit, fachlicher Grund statt Pauschalmeldung, Mandant aus dem Kontext.\n* Delegation: Zahlungslauf freigeben, Lieferschein drucken, Reklamation\n  abschliessen (Zustandsmaschine), Eingangsrechnung freigeben, Mahnstufe.\n* Lieferant \"neue Bestellung\": Sprung in die Bestellerfassung.\n* Ohne Fachweg (stubReason, Handler entfernt): Lead qualifizieren,\n  Opportunity-Aktivitaet, Angebot -> Bestellung, Wareneingang am Avis,\n  Lagerbewegung stornieren, Ernte-Abrechnung drucken.\n* Drei Tests, die den Fake festschrieben, auf das ehrliche Verhalten umgestellt.\n\nNachweis: 29 neue Vertraege gegen valeo_probe; 1035 Fach-/SD-/UIX-Tests gruen\n(1 rot vorbestehend: fahrzeug-stamm dangerLevel destructive); fuenf Ratschen\ngruen. Neue Befunde in der QA-Doku (Mandant bei approve_payment_run/\napprove_ap_invoice, Opportunity-Aktivitaet, Angebotsumwandlung, Mahnstufe).\n\nQA: docs/quality-assurance/mask-aktionen-wirkung-20261007.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"488b04bccd2e41c147252d6e2d0d1a434e287c69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/488b04bccd2e41c147252d6e2d0d1a434e287c69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/af2b90facfc421f323ccb92b35875bd0a17b8bad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.co