WY2MDY1ODJiNDJmNzc5NGZlMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/5059231b944725c2a2af1282d935818ba614808b","sha":"5059231b944725c2a2af1282d935818ba614808b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/5059231b944725c2a2af1282d935818ba614808b"}],"sha":"53a48c575ebfab6e1560af606582b42f7794fe2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/53a48c575ebfab6e1560af606582b42f7794fe2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commits/5059231b944725c2a2af1282d935818ba614808b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:47:37Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:47:37Z","email":"codex@openai.com","name":"Codex"},"message":"fix(mask-builder): Auswahl ohne vorgetaeuschte Wahl, Fehler erst nach Beruehrung\n\nSichtpruefung der Einwilligungsmasken in der laufenden App (Playwright gegen\nechte API) fand zwei Plattformfehler und drei in der Maske:\n\n* FieldRenderer: Ein Auswahlfeld ohne Platzhalter hatte keine leere Option;\n  der Browser zeigte die erste Option als gewaehlt, waehrend der Wert leer war.\n  Jetzt \"Bitte waehlen\" (oder der SD-Platzhalter); der zugaengliche Name\n  bleibt die Feldbezeichnung.\n* useUniversalFormState: neue visibleFieldErrors/revealErrors - Fehler\n  bearbeiteter Felder sofort, alle nach einem Absendeversuch. fieldErrors und\n  validationPlan bleiben vollstaendig; die Sperre gilt weiter fuer alle Felder.\n* Einwilligungsmasken: resetForm statt setValue nach Erfolg, einheitliches\n  Datumsformat (formatReadOnlyValue), \"Erteilt am\" als Datum, \"1 Fassung\".\n\nNachweis: 13 Formularzustand-, 14 Seiten-, 272 Mask-Builder/Features-Tests;\ntsc 0 Fehler. Frontend-Vollauf 963 gruen, 8 rot aus fremdem WIP an\nbutton/input/checkbox und dem bekannten Schulungen-Altvertrag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf432161bf02d1d6a25c602b2166d3d2c6b9a748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/bf432161bf02d1d6a25c602b2166d3d2c6b9a748"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/5059231b944725c2a2af1282d935818ba614808b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co