beiden\n  Datenbanken identisch.\n* 42/42 Einwilligungsvertraege und 52/52 Loeschlaufvertraege gegen den\n  Pruefstand gruen; Tabellenverweis-Ratsche OK.\n\nSlice im Workboard abgeschlossen; Punkt 4 im Loeschlauf-Dokument geschlossen.\nOffen als eigene Slices: Maske, Selbstwiderruf, versionierte Erklaerung.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08a55db43772f3d7ec3644c1ee1f0b5b4742b3d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/trees/08a55db43772f3d7ec3644c1ee1f0b5b4742b3d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/git/commits/22de0b680add0931d0ee6957be0c03fcfa085210","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267193182?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/codex","id":267193182,"login":"codex","node_id":"U_kgDOD-0LXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/codex","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/22de0b680add0931d0ee6957be0c03fcfa085210","node_id":"C_kwDOP_xA6NoAKDIyZGUwYjY4MGFkZDA5MzFkMGVlNjk1N2JlMGMwM2ZjZmEwODUyMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JochenWeerda/VALEO-NeuroERP-3.0/commit/19bafc0233906911b0e9ba0f63da083bdc3455ee","sh