/users/svaccari/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/svaccari","id":7923589,"login":"svaccari","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MjM1ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/svaccari","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/1910a8da34456501aaff725ad3e9d97a21f88324/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:42:52Z","email":"stefano.vaccari@varda.ag","name":"svaccari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:42:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: supporting plugin requiresAuth (#865)\n\nAdd a parameter to the plugin config to specify if non-authenticated\nuser can have access to the plugin:\n```\n  requiresAuth?: boolean;\n```\nOther changes:\n- NoAuthProvider change to `isAuthenticated: false` (was: true)\n- Dynamic login redirect URL matching pre-login page\n- “Please login to use …” component\n- Fixing password login unmounting the app\n- OIDC silent renew no longer remounts the app\n\n<img width=\"389\" height=\"147\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a2653ca-a059-419c-90df-b6baba410b5a\"\n/>","tree":{"sha":"f3c343efc74668735023bb502633f31362f12a15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/f3c343efc74668735023bb502633f31362f12a15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/1910a8da34456501aaff725ad3e9d97a21f88324","verification":{"payload":"tree f3c343efc74668735023bb502633f31362f12a15\nparent c08ca2186bebe254017bf936cc0c1fb3d38cc8f7\nauthor svaccari <stefano.vaccari@varda.ag> 1790836972 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790836972 +0200\n\nfeat: supporting plugin requiresAuth (#865)\n\nAdd a parameter to the plugin config to specify if non-authenticated\nuser can have access to the plugin:\n```\n  requiresAuth?: boolean;\n```\nOther changes:\n- NoAuthProvider change to `isAuthenticated: false` (was: true)\n- Dynamic login redirect URL matching pre-login page\n- “Please login to use …” component\n- Fixing password login unmounting the app\n- OIDC silent renew no longer remounts the app\n\n<img width=\"389\" height=\"147\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a2653ca-a059-419c-90df-b6baba410b5a\"\n/>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvgDsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAR/wQAB6fwhbClpQ1ogQDIti81lJ+\nITeS5FEY8eiAiA/A5Ouf4909Hxeqb4k/gx95kZNQohM901kNCi12ZOAVwiqdOd/e\nGAHd5uDvQ5CERiLmbxJZifCcnEzwcyDbRByC2M70jrmWFSd7WFIwXgPoYDlJWInX\nzro5LQl7Jj939RQJTn/AOLNZgA/JvieNPyXb+mwfStHflcfQUQxKJxa3iiTlOOzm\nI8FxrYkhVhxvdkXwN9emcaiav7ybdveJEZiTcF7bGKVsgx+XCD1iVqOiv2wviNaR\n1jwv10zvgfvMOveZMWb9Z17PJ6A+BGFMhqJJCHEEmaTK3jxwpqGJ4xBnCJw9zEVJ\nVLP5TIVJjVyvwgOUNTmO4pg/I6+QN6Rd7rVC6L9qudKuOHR/zH5N2bnxQhajROQT\ntPqaTDokII8x94G+uTqOZTLlDGBvOhnZWyBSSgdTVvjzTn3SctSPLIPG5+TiuKsJ\nbOlPuB++fUe+Op/k4y6YC1xdrZeYDy3fXpgrI4wZcmbob4kN/8W5hu2vUAerA6kf\nzIvol4CFOytVMSgGdlr46ovUKPPHUF63FApiWaT/d/4NMCJYpW1/caPzikpDUQgv\nuw863E88JJXqUwwDBLjmgJluy6ehenS8AGF5Ui1uN5zIEum3XojksLx0lo0taLu7\nvHrjAZpScmZ5/0a/AZMa\n=94Dw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T06:42:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo