admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristbello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristbello/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cristbello","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/c08ca2186bebe254017bf936cc0c1fb3d38cc8f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:02:14Z","email":"153092107+cristbello@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cristbello"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:02:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: sp-5704 catch plugin render errors with a route errorElement (#864)\n\nA plugin that threw while rendering took down the whole app: no route\nhad an errorElement, so react-router''s default error screen replaced\neverything, header included.\n\nEach plugin route now has errorElement={<PluginErrorPage />}. The error\nstays inside the plugin''s route: the header keeps working, the error is\nlogged to the console, and navigating anywhere else clears it. This also\ncatches errors thrown inside a plugin''s own nested <Routes>.\n\n<img width=\"1843\" height=\"1188\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 13 02 44\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa9a4239-3129-43e3-b020-475affae0c2d\"\n/>","tree":{"sha":"130e528f7e9f3e8bda30cb9e3174789d876dcd0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/130e528f7e9f3e8bda30cb9e3174789d876dcd0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/c08ca2186bebe254017bf936cc0c1fb3d38cc8f7","verification":{"payload":"tree 130e528f7e9f3e8bda30cb9e3174789d876dcd0f\nparent 706e4d68dfc664e9b6094bfdc5182f5df504fd22\nauthor cristbello <153092107+cristbello@users.noreply.github.com> 1790773334 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790773334 +0200\n\nfix: sp-5704 catch plugin render errors with a route errorElement (#864)\n\nA plugin that threw while rendering took down the whole app: no route\nhad an errorElement, so react-router''s default error screen replaced\neverything, header included.\n\nEach plugin route now has errorElement={<PluginErrorPage />}. The error\nstays inside the plugin''s route: the header keeps working, the error is\nlogged to the console, and navigating anywhere else clears it. This also\ncatches errors thrown inside a plugin''s own nested <Routes>.\n\n<img width=\"1843\" height=\"1188\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-30 at 13 02 44\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa9a4239-3129-43e3-b020-475affae0c2d\"\n/>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvQhWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtdsQAB4UeIhBSz1V7M0eSEkeivUa\ng+7TGL6zE9T2eTn6UfG5rtXoJChIeGtvQ68QZbEcF1slBaQfZ+MZ+DGj2ITp33M5\n1TC1BKEI8WV9+N/jStDnuE4/VPPt0dKHSBABGG7hRmGYAfRl72lhg9af53tITb4C\nqw+LsmLucq5gKoiCT/pZ8Jw1S5nYq1fNHq6uKeoqBQ7WTNwFvO98Iw9xW1YE0IvO\nLWDyz+7wHp/wme59l+OHcR7T7e4VMInRSyW6Zll5MojZnz3zgyXgHVrgKWA3E7F1\nhyVHDpw61vLk8ItgcczYyEJDYUiZhAAbhXHOc8tA4qaJY9QiBoMWLB88EV84bK5o\njTITPIZo0vWLcpTQhF7nl9FLYQaW6nKXBUXo34pwpJrvwadmq8YwQ3IPIrNxESf6\nIaJ8A7XIuqBlxHVEC3A2MA44vWlGh908u/0uM+z5PlifRUvLrgneH6FOYUtPIZWV\nkqxNZybvZuM/QkiZDhgBrbUaBwulOkfTf0oMlffL2gyeyW3D4g7kPYDOY1rSidWe\nLqNlROoxDZ9Xp8RKOBIRvQVCFckR5W5HWYW6RGihCo29uRlXxHkz9KVi4JFv52nT\nM+q5HGiv+NeSff4S2yRrHwTo2pLgYijWjPIGK1sU0pGRuGwZkSEOwnPmiu0S7qaz\nKniNHxPoO3i6svAz3DJP\n=RR2x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T13:02:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_u