//api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commit/b69ede436cb7b5d54a94814c35f860e92f61adbb","node_id":"C_kwDOP_6DBNoAKGI2OWVkZTQzNmNiN2I1ZDU0YTk0ODE0YzM1Zjg2MGU5MmY2MWFkYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commit/33e43a580691a0d4261a1b7c90359ab33bbbbd39","sha":"33e43a580691a0d4261a1b7c90359ab33bbbbd39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/33e43a580691a0d4261a1b7c90359ab33bbbbd39"}],"sha":"b69ede436cb7b5d54a94814c35f860e92f61adbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/b69ede436cb7b5d54a94814c35f860e92f61adbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56585589?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-rom","id":56585589,"login":"d-rom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTg1NTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-rom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/33e43a580691a0d4261a1b7c90359ab33bbbbd39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:11:19Z","email":"daria.marassanova@varda.ag","name":"Daria Ruiz-Ogarrio Marassanova"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:11:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: invalid footprint geometries, BaseEntity bound to destroyed datasource (#859)\n\nFixes `raster-load`bug: \n`QueryFailedError: lwgeom_intersection_prec: GEOS Error:\nTopologyException: side location conflict at 23.434646223436619\n67.115422460643543. This can occur if the input geometry is invalid.`\nAdditionally, application throwing `TypeORMError: Driver not Connected`\nbecause of the migrations datasource defaults includeEntities to true,\nso `.initialize()` rebinds every BaseEntity-derived class''s static\ndataSource to the throwaway migrations instance — then immediately\n`.destroy()`s it. If this runs after the app''s real runtime\n`getDataSource()` singleton has already been created and bound (a\nstartup-ordering race, not deterministic), every `entity.save()` call\nanywhere in the app is left pointing at a destroyed pool, permanently,\nuntil the process restarts.","tree":{"sha":"3d916a1a480c1c750ace976734328b2e82082a4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/3d916a1a480c1c750ace976734328b2e82082a4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/33e43a580691a0d4261a1b7c90359ab33bbbbd39","verification":{"payload":"tree 3d916a1a480c1c750ace976734328b2e82082a4b\nparent 4d5d058c67404a4a9ecc70b80cc83139b850c670\nauthor Daria Ruiz-Ogarrio Marassanova <daria.marassanova@varda.ag> 1790687479 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790687479 +0200\n\nfix: invalid footprint geometries, BaseEntity bound to destroyed datasource (#859)\n\nFixes `raster-load`bug: \n`QueryFailedError: lwgeom_intersection_prec: GEOS Error:\nTopologyException: side location conflict at 23.434646223436619\n67.115422460643543. This can occur if the input geometry is invalid.`\nAdditionally, application throwing `TypeORMError: Driver not Connected`\nbecause of the migrations datasource defaults includeEntities to true,\nso `.initialize()` rebinds every BaseEntity-derived class''s static\ndataSource to the throwaway migrations instance — then immediately\n`.destroy()`s it. If this runs after the app''s real runtime\n`getDataSource()` singleton has already been created and bound (a\nstartup-ordering race, not deterministic), every `entity.save()` call\nanywhere in the app is left pointing at a destroyed pool, permanently,\nuntil the process restarts.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu7j3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi50QAFStGCY8dMt85ss/Iyz3XGM1\nDUd9J9wDh5cOW3y+/fOoZ3e6TiLTjcAQwCepSRaJjfms4RsRPZ24nG9VqN2llXiA\nIqn4TOOyJnz+C2Al8jt81bzATvV49FpLAnSF+664Ldrc3gWS9ctDv5df8fKwKKxe\nSSqtfUhM8lVrU0IPIT/f7ckA3P2D6u6fTLTO7ty0eOjM59/RYPO3jukdfRPCaRyr\nJZlZtiSrMeEVdNTLCCms2BDhCGmgt1JGWvDxcL66dCy8sehkRvedVQvX1sbZsWPy\nwoRduEOrqNSU1phbmVwomWKQENONfuMjRuk/qFOWVEcnYJgvAbCd1pjUTg14nLh3\nM9VLqmZErnn1o8BHvdlh1TOu2TSDFjctyJo8Z/LuwQRNhMDAdz1Sd5FIzHHsg3m3\n1UwfhbHcUxzn7wO7QKYPguCWvsmF/Lpps7vDWFmgvbk0FfE1/ZFlhsNx0UwFAaXM\ngaAkxneXwcPVQszhI0XFWgzwuE5cbsyOwlT59C8+5R1tBUEOr+TSf8S96jTdJNmu\nL66VsYIfS+FpiE/wepP1c2KF++7zjsDqFhCf7RVP17ER3JeM/Ij+asMHBBzs8rMs\n5OBTU4TkLmiLknwf7zmKFu+4Y24GlK6Ei84J3cvF+73vVWgy1eQTnZNnLAt8PWWr\nKOC6RD7m6KC5A6xvzFZp\n=kMHK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T13:11:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http