epos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/dfa3225c24adc50a582279401a6dc5e6ea7272f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232349910?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VardAlb","id":232349910,"login":"VardAlb","node_id":"U_kgDODdlg1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/56f4b95ce1b1f62ce5b7e602c6e28e389b218cc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:52:19Z","email":"alberto.arpini@varda.ag","name":"VardAlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:52:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: sp-5680 do not reuse an aborted in-flight request in useApiQuery (#857)\n\n**Problem:**\n\nThe host runs in React.StrictMode\n(soilhive-core/frontend/src/bootstrap.tsx:55). In dev mode, StrictMode\nmounts each component, removes it, and mounts it again. With\nuseFilteredCoverageQuery, this goes wrong in\nsoilhive-core/frontend/src/hooks/useApiQuery.ts:\n\n1. The widget mounts, and React Query starts the fetch.\n2. StrictMode removes the widget. The query has no observers now, so\nReact Query cancels the fetch. The hook reads signal, so the cancel\nreally stops the request.\n3. The widget mounts again, and React Query calls fetchData again. But\nthe old request is still in inflightRequests, because its finally has\nnot run yet. So fetchData gets the cancelled request back.\n4. That request fails with AbortError. The hook sets ignoreAbortError:\ntrue, so useRequest returns null instead of an error\n(api-client/useRequest.ts).\n5. React Query stores null as a good result and keeps it for\nQUERY_STALE_TIME (10 minutes). coverage?.datasets ?? [] is then empty,\nso the Variable list is empty.\n\n**Fix**\nRemove the request from inflightRequests as soon as its signal aborts,\nand delete an entry only while it still belongs to the same request.","tree":{"sha":"6ed931b7a784f7a9f0a0264dbf00d9ddef6fcbdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/6ed931b7a784f7a9f0a0264dbf00d9ddef6fcbdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/56f4b95ce1b1f62ce5b7e602c6e28e389b218cc3","verification":{"payload":"tree 6ed931b7a784f7a9f0a0264dbf00d9ddef6fcbdb\nparent 24203cfa87920fbc149ad5355482501d476fe1e2\nauthor VardAlb <alberto.arpini@varda.ag> 1790664739 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790664739 +0200\n\nfix: sp-5680 do not reuse an aborted in-flight request in useApiQuery (#857)\n\n**Problem:**\n\nThe host runs in React.StrictMode\n(soilhive-core/frontend/src/bootstrap.tsx:55). In dev mode, StrictMode\nmounts each component, removes it, and mounts it again. With\nuseFilteredCoverageQuery, this goes wrong in\nsoilhive-core/frontend/src/hooks/useApiQuery.ts:\n\n1. The widget mounts, and React Query starts the fetch.\n2. StrictMode removes the widget. The query has no observers now, so\nReact Query cancels the fetch. The hook reads signal, so the cancel\nreally stops the request.\n3. The widget mounts again, and React Query calls fetchData again. But\nthe old request is still in inflightRequests, because its finally has\nnot run yet. So fetchData gets the cancelled request back.\n4. That request fails with AbortError. The hook sets ignoreAbortError:\ntrue, so useRequest returns null instead of an error\n(api-client/useRequest.ts).\n5. React Query stores null as a good result and keeps it for\nQUERY_STALE_TIME (10 minutes). coverage?.datasets ?? [] is then empty,\nso the Variable list is empty.\n\n**Fix**\nRemove the request from inflightRequests as soon as its signal aborts,\nand delete an entry only while it still belongs to the same request.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu2AjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXWQQAAQBx0fTWM66t0mKAsbarLwh\nA98jGjJ6hTLjTrcKoh0pgeodIVx1DbCobDwjiVD2SkIvr2UMpFUkgE6cUbYlD07x\nkIiLk/mAwAXPly9pmROZOVQdPVVvn5pi4e0gTTxi83QkTHBgwKPFqD/sedQHPSEB\nSMJo7a6VPvb0LFqcu1YxzNh7oMFqANL4fVnBqgguS6dCrGWCP6cOC4oomXYYCBYS\nljgCEXpd78tfdNdu69GKwTmuXGlE5/SKlHsj4MKVDF/Pc2cNmbLfEXdE/qTQsWAl\ntTVj7WH4llw02oepHbi2qSO9UroTKw3hvNLyDjknxvnY3DCqu4F1ebAPabR5LHIh\n9MBJ37cKM7KIX3ALMcjvhl1/2cT4ZbtG2UP81o8pppkrm11SCcXhQHqk1U1yJ5fu\n6NJJ3V1w6ijB0DXdVmlL8X9L9q2+k3MHWdRLTcQ9RHtEGkFwMZr88kCD75Mi0NeQ\nQyDvaENwEetCRGRZ5nR5LxvShXX8w/4K+7tkaaQizA0dUlwYPcr/81JTmmrVsZtJ\n2a+y2pY29EVPqrO+onoUdjvKH8q56dtDz+sbt1e7P05121LBF2PQ+UNq5pWIEShV\ntW7hEhI5DVb7POTTFndsgfudqgXG6bu8jmpe7zfDDHOXRqGM2Vcb71woEtMKiEmt\nS1OyaUhvzZ1OaXVzizTC\n=AZ+x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T06:52:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_a