t the host puts on\n`PluginContext`. The host owns these types for all plugins.","tree":{"sha":"da3e1e4dee50375bdfb02f47dd454d70718b8622","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/da3e1e4dee50375bdfb02f47dd454d70718b8622"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/c6a7c8b8760984223c8dabd175f2af3ecc1fad99","verification":{"payload":"tree da3e1e4dee50375bdfb02f47dd454d70718b8622\nparent 0d7cee84db6ccbf751463db5836660e38148a7c3\nauthor VardAlb <alberto.arpini@varda.ag> 1790327978 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790327978 +0200\n\nfeat: sp-5680 add data request contract to plugin types (#853)\n\n## Summary\n\nThis PR adds the Data Request contract that plugins use. It adds only\nthe types and a stub. It does not add the real hook behavior.\n\nThe `dashboards` plugin needs Data Requests for its widgets. A plugin\ndoes not call the backend directly. It uses hooks that the host puts on\n`PluginContext`. The host owns these types for all plugins.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtjyqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYi0QAAf6/5/iiWu+ITQajtYXCSlh\nV3BipUrfi6dHB/sUpF53QEYB8C4oPbXS7S6ZNKg2p26nRl3R55wLRVtA5/AUZ9IL\n55cIkVcVnQVoRRCxI58fDXFAFpuex2vuMT+CcWyF96tv3uA3lUXnCIHKMidIdI+K\n3cVCAWC0khCSSdnq3vX/fdvEWxpXlDWaFmHEuVX9/76Jw6dXzYHeQdOmM9/N6b2w\nED4YF+0S9iBpIquv84L2T141tBTjCvbGjIlv9whvRhSBGl+xy+6Hbd4Y8fK5uMM3\nBSHDfCHyph2sQ+xQj2ZFInYxWxqAtT1uYrDYSBhWF+ABKJ7jbtFKIXqsCJAE4SZI\nJO7UJlL91b4YCYkRvsKU9MrrYhqW8UWXa0oHaA/Uu5V0y8sHgLV/RFBYFN1UzYjV\nQIIW3/hP6YHXzOYcu8flEUkrhqzqC5UrTqDRZN3NWbszmvpHGBfWrna1YmCLZRXJ\n/bGWNZI2gyS22Azx2+IMbOYd5Owqv0r4UkYW41IyJrMqKc74GsOGMq31l5GCFhKh\n1jsOC3cIMnITqZnyAWNJt/eIYgh6jMTxmChlh5RxVjkbDKWmSRRhL2i6ObeSRSNl\npspPbIdzSkBRIGJ9qeqrfU7Hv/pAreeJfHrXHnDLbglYsq+f/AnP/OeXp4VUwQFb\n3IGhofkjtXKJPuTCYlFC\n=rPC7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T09:19:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864