ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commit/58490ce803c20c5c9bf4a6904cadb0a217cb8369","node_id":"C_kwDOP_6DBNoAKDU4NDkwY2U4MDNjMjBjNWM5YmY0YTY5MDRjYWRiMGEyMTdjYjgzNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commit/f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86","sha":"f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86"}],"sha":"58490ce803c20c5c9bf4a6904cadb0a217cb8369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/58490ce803c20c5c9bf4a6904cadb0a217cb8369"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232349910?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VardAlb","id":232349910,"login":"VardAlb","node_id":"U_kgDODdlg1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:24:07Z","email":"alberto.arpini@varda.ag","name":"VardAlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:24:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: sp-5633 add frontend config entitlements hooks (#843)\n\n## Summary\nAdd frontend hooks to read and set entitlement grants on config items,\nusing the\nalready-merged backend endpoints `GET`/`PUT\n/config/{configId}/entitlements` (PR #834).\n\n- **Host-facing**: `useConfigEntitlements(configId)` and\n`useConfigEntitlementsMutation(configId)`,\n  mirroring the existing `useDatasetEntitlements` split.\n- **Plugin-facing**: `usePluginConfigEntitlements(pluginId, configId)`\nand\n`usePluginConfigEntitlementsMutation(pluginId, configId)`, which build\nthe\n`plugin:{pluginId}:{configId}` key internally, mirroring\n`usePluginConfig`.\n- Both hooks are wired straight through into `PluginContext` so a remote\nplugin can call them.\n- `frontend-plugin-types` gains `PluginConfigEntitlements`,\n`PluginConfigEntitlementCapability`,\nand a generic `PluginMutationResult` shape for the mutation hook''s\nreturn type.\n\n`GET` suppresses the error toast (`showErrorNotification: false`) since\na 403 on an unclaimed\nconfig is expected, not a failure — `isError` still surfaces for the\ncaller to branch on.","tree":{"sha":"4dab25c51c4836b406d3239e840b4a54c67a97f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/4dab25c51c4836b406d3239e840b4a54c67a97f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86","verification":{"payload":"tree 4dab25c51c4836b406d3239e840b4a54c67a97f2\nparent 1f0ab072a8d18b02ec858b8c7c1a8bb81e3e204e\nauthor VardAlb <alberto.arpini@varda.ag> 1789997047 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789997047 +0200\n\nfeat: sp-5633 add frontend config entitlements hooks (#843)\n\n## Summary\nAdd frontend hooks to read and set entitlement grants on config items,\nusing the\nalready-merged backend endpoints `GET`/`PUT\n/config/{configId}/entitlements` (PR #834).\n\n- **Host-facing**: `useConfigEntitlements(configId)` and\n`useConfigEntitlementsMutation(configId)`,\n  mirroring the existing `useDatasetEntitlements` split.\n- **Plugin-facing**: `usePluginConfigEntitlements(pluginId, configId)`\nand\n`usePluginConfigEntitlementsMutation(pluginId, configId)`, which build\nthe\n`plugin:{pluginId}:{configId}` key internally, mirroring\n`usePluginConfig`.\n- Both hooks are wired straight through into `PluginContext` so a remote\nplugin can call them.\n- `frontend-plugin-types` gains `PluginConfigEntitlements`,\n`PluginConfigEntitlementCapability`,\nand a generic `PluginMutationResult` shape for the mutation hook''s\nreturn type.\n\n`GET` suppresses the error toast (`showErrorNotification: false`) since\na 403 on an unclaimed\nconfig is expected, not a failure — `isError` still surfaces for the\ncaller to branch on.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsS/3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbV4QAHxPL/ubS4PDupf7mQ7jbUGD\nfMNmfCuTE8e3uoTZhpwWiueBoqrMjO00nv+zwPAYpX/6njv5fDe4EkKw9ToxQ3C4\nsNQKs0JgawiC+38PXTl5r/LurJGFIboo1oEea/1FqIRdZA6WBlleNSNN8g1lT6+/\nFDqPBzLREjpIT+GiVWJQnXfNSaaKAKDk3V4iAh+u0vVVOFtKH/3ieMNks9uUQNeG\nmrhoudn3zvS55WkirbZupdyUM7GQgwKms3vKJFImNy/c/e9+9cwUzrjjT6i9STxk\nrRMiSMOAx8zfbBw8HSCCXOjya4p8sO1fcM0gdb/cpzzDROqm781Zu2dsmIWN12Et\nA4i5wraOvlL7I3NFKheAmS3mnu4TkHqEtHRcAKMIV7PjiqTjXr2ZT8wnL2rXyVt3\n8k/zn25Ak0cvJo9vs0fW5ceOkkZv1IzU88j4xE1ae8tkEyIs7EW5fU0YIdfQbSu7\nmEby7JygHfFvLGu2zRXLmdgkm2ZzZmdVTdqRuLCkAPU0sefG9qzDDz61/chVdatM\nyGlTFkB5WN5A2ZDAKmZY+GE9woLvRaMRL0uR8w1Ui0GXw99Wl9v65dFK90TAmMsA\njGQLleKYEXNXiZGogPW7HnIMiS9ikuYEdLs9OEKGI8F3jsByIxsNmeRL8AJujnJF\n7yHgvJnTzjbEijpPZB5v\n=+Og3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T13:24:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commit/f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86","node_id":"C_kwDOP_6DBNoAKGY4NjM3Y2YzZGE2MzYyZGFkZDViNDJjZjNhNmVmYWJiMDJjN2NjODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commit/1f0ab072a8d18b02ec858b8c7c1a8bb81e3e204e","sha":"1f0ab072a8d18b02ec858b8c7c1a8bb81e3e204e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/1f0ab072a8d18b02ec858b8c7c1a8bb81e3e204e"}],"sha":"f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/f8637cf3da6362dadd5b42cf3a6efabb02c7cc86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232349910?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VardAlb","id":232349910,"login":"VardAlb","node_id":"U_kgDODdlg1g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VardAlb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/1f0ab072a8d18b02ec858b8c7c1a8bb81e3e204e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:37:08Z","email":"alberto.arpini@varda.ag","name":"VardAlb"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T11:37:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: sp-5633 add config entitlements (#834)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdd entitlement grant management for config items (`jsonstorage` rows),\nmirroring the\nexisting dataset entitlements pattern from ADR-0032.\n\n- `GET /config/{configId}/entitlements` let a regular user check the\nentitlements on that configId if they are entitled so\n- `PUT /config/{configId}/entitlements` let a regular user set an\nentitlement for a config that belongs to a plugin (the config id must be\nin the form plugin:{pluginId}:{configId}) if no entitlement exists yet\nor an entitlement exists that grant write access to that config.\nPrivileged users can set any config\n- Config items have no `slug` or slug-history, so `configId` is used\ndirectly as the\nentitlement key. `EntitlementService.resolveSlugs` had to be patched to\navoid a config key to be considered a slug\n- `PUT /config/{configId}/entitlements` payload is now checked against\nthe expected schema to avoid accepting malicious entitlements\n- `EntitlementService.getUserEntitlements` had to be patched to\ndefensively check entitlements shape before using them\n- `EntityScope` is removed from `Entitlements.ts` and\n`EntitlementService.ts`. It excluded\n`CONFIGS` from the entitlement write path; now that configs have a write\npath, it is\n  identical to `EntitlementScope` and unused elsewhere in the codebase.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Wiring `enforceEntitlements` into `GET`/`PUT /config/{configId}` (it\nwill be addressed with a dedicated ticket).\n- Frontend changes.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: svaccari <stefano.vaccari@varda.ag>","tree":{"sha":"51565095f0d22ba0100101f5d7a63593c148fa4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/51565095f0d22ba0100101f5d7a63593c148fa4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/1f0ab072a8d18b02ec858b8c7c1a8bb81e3e204e","verification":{"payload":"tree 51565095f0d22ba0100101f5d7a63593c148fa4e\nparent ab3bdaaec800f4f74d45e479879610c53a539b32\nauthor VardAlb <alberto.arpini@varda.ag> 1789990628 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789990628 +0200\n\nfeat: sp-5633 add config entitlements (#834)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdd entitlement grant management for config items (`jsonstorage` rows),\nmirroring the\nexisting dataset entitlements pattern from ADR-0032.\n\n- `GET /config/{configId}/entitlements` let a regular user check the\nentitlements on that configId if they are entitled so\n- `PUT /config/{configId}/entitlements` let a regular user set an\nentitlement for a config that belongs to a plugin (the config id must be\nin the form plugin:{pluginId}:{configId}) if no entitlement exists yet\nor an entitlement exists that grant write access to that config.\nPrivileged users can set any config\n- Config items have no `slug` or slug-history, so `configId` is used\ndirectly as the\nentitlement key. `EntitlementService.resolveSlugs` had to be patched to\navoid a config key to be considered a slug\n- `PUT /config/{configId}/entitlements` payload is now checked against\nthe expected schema to avoid accepting malicious entitlements\n- `EntitlementService.getUserEntitlements` had to be patched to\ndefensively check entitlements shape before using them\n- `EntityScope` is removed from `Entitlements.ts` and\n`EntitlementService.ts`. It excluded\n`CONFIGS` from the entitlement write path; now that configs have a write\npath, it is\n  identical to `EntitlementScope` and unused elsewhere in the codebase.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Wiring `enforceEntitlements` into `GET`/`PUT /config/{configId}` (it\nwill be addressed with a dedicated ticket).\n- Frontend changes.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: svaccari <stefano.vaccari@varda.ag>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsRbkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC14QAJRPMfdGMpUA3ctAXnHCCUMe\nxKGxmfSDNnc/WbZHlyxyvqcoYGGQTqU3LFhbfq/aD1/nrRYzrStOaP1K3zXzDtOk\nbhN1BbXwzjKFTDt/Xa3usEyRaeLlRF02itJT0LcKFY845t0aoqM6K4gb7zhJaXsI\n1FRSZD9KWzigTeMCWTRjZqdU3Pk2eK0mkxjsZ4W8Gaxj3mPYEMCeWBPyzD1bGjNi\n4NZnHcBrPtewbKAweMWEhwNH4p8U0u8NLmQGagwjWWQlEepmHuoshOUyL4jQUNnK\nVeq8BjebOtsQCIoCg2/fnw5OaEVV3HEMvZ15YiF5vOFJrvCSNpx5BY0izp3GOdiQ\nykY0055Ky+r9YmdsIdt1qhUSBuy/bKr18Pdvuxc+BnHik7QM/fISNR3Yt4+mdiwV\njTS/wjDvFyemhrWqr7hEu4o7kgmKykwLfRfb2eTErYZlR/+mOJw3HtjsBUJ9Ob+5\niZv3rv9OSV8S9ewLq63Wb2BKyQ/35HYGUv+P5/lIYLrNahGi9fCr769Si3uob5AS\nG+I+QLLvaEH/D7yNZ2zmGZJyuIh8ZyQDf2nnSBtFlLNnmi6L1VRq2fFFQuWkfhDN\n16vSFalfodbw0e0F5blZFKRuAUM9fJrDA8p2rQDwW1TL2K1pIXHE53sQvXAxV5dF\nSDs0H6Iv8BhGGd9kmYuK\n=yA2/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T11:37:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subs