arctica) backed\nby a bundled Natural Earth boundary dataset, merged via\nmaplibre-gl-geocoder''s localGeocoder hook. Also filters out duplicate\nNominatim point results for the same name once a continent match is\nfound.\n<img width=\"2870\" height=\"2706\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/515a8499-68bf-4cf5-ba35-ca7a20fb803f\"\n/>","tree":{"sha":"b59a155e673503892a6dd1051e81d0e27a6fa282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/b59a155e673503892a6dd1051e81d0e27a6fa282"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/94ba4a515e3596de84a9cfec1785692af77795d7","verification":{"payload":"tree b59a155e673503892a6dd1051e81d0e27a6fa282\nparent 13b8da2e3038b68491e70a4dff01a5a37304b3e7\nauthor cristbello <153092107+cristbello@users.noreply.github.com> 1789719027 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789719027 +0200\n\nfeat: sp-5653 extend map geocoder to support continent search (#835)\n\nNominatim doesn''t index continents, so add a local geocoder supplement\n(Africa, Asia, Europe, North/South America, Oceania, Antarctica) backed\nby a bundled Natural Earth boundary dataset, merged via\nmaplibre-gl-geocoder''s localGeocoder hook. Also filters out duplicate\nNominatim point results for the same name once a continent match is\nfound.\n<img width=\"2870\" height=\"2706\" alt=\"image\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/515a8499-68bf-4cf5-ba35-ca7a20fb803f\"\n/>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrPHzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvuAQAFQ94JG2XFLgkqG+TpzLHzX2\nutH1knMdwl1/FZzxpzGla88gRrRRH2GIeORwZWUP9S9RqM/qPaB5whtyiSfpbc2U\nvwVDVwpXHLiGjeGe05mnaPXsJELAdzOnYRi98jUC14zgsACEaUG41Ey45kINULWv\nbji/nrbAwbM1Sp0Ky+oojO3yxq6fLcgWCCfoOFI5Hlceh0TPtV2MPKDMf35dS+2B\nhHTdKJH5ESfciaQkAqOaFrtuLjJ3L5D3mMGwfwpaXxgyTu+TE8gc1tS0D0AbRAzS\nwXzOW+i6bIG4u8fRoimfSBExXC040U9a25SkEJ1UcPH9s9zIjRrtuZsctd9WkvQ4\n56oyMzvLA3J/hkKnGdE8RHGsjF3KDIEWGuwlNtdXXGu/izcffYeRPMQJ1Hr