mail":"153092107+cristbello@users.noreply.github.com","name":"cristbello"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T07:00:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: raster mapping continue goes straight to data-loading-started panel (#811)\n\nPreviously clicking Continue showed the \"Mapping fields\" spinner for the\nwhole save + raster-load job duration, only swapping to \"Data loading\nstarted\" once the job finished. Show that panel immediately instead, for\nboth the click flow and a mount/reload while the backend still reports\nan in-flight import.","tree":{"sha":"cbe3d5d9e538ed7c5a9a74826a3444c3d71d6466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/cbe3d5d9e538ed7c5a9a74826a3444c3d71d6466"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/66f752998a181dfd83938b2aa5e956d13283875d","verification":{"payload":"tree cbe3d5d9e538ed7c5a9a74826a3444c3d71d6466\nparent 83687f6c59cd8bb30a8654ce3fec105d914a637d\nauthor cristbello <153092107+cristbello@users.noreply.github.com> 1787900454 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787900454 +0200\n\nfix: raster mapping continue goes straight to data-loading-started panel (#811)\n\nPreviously clicking Continue showed the \"Mapping fields\" spinner for the\nwhole save + raster-load job duration, only swapping to \"Data loading\nstarted\" once the job finished. Show that panel immediately instead, for\nboth the click flow and a mount/reload while the backend still reports\nan in-flight import.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkTImCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1pAQAK3Vf70OqQ4k9lScTm2rQ0GU\nVVkfpJ2q3NIEIy6XNU2rM/bn8C38Rg17ZwWc5aq6lj9Vtivt7MaVtJT8DAkUIovD\nb4GnfNMoeS+lW4HvXBf4L/W6c/OO5D5puvpmTmuJAb0Y66yH8cDoTI1IgKDp7r1X\nh0wkcrrrXcuMPprAK0WU5kYUH2QgXNBvNwxWXGItP0L0LcTJm+BtYxyw0/FdQrYR\n1UBavTKJCk1F7NI3czOI0j/nfWbRs8DwTw1XTFbexA5I2cDzcOGJ0LwH6Z97KtSx\nEBnWlhFER/If06motfoojUYs+jQM7w6+kj4+DfBqYo5gloWBfr894dSvn1X4S4In\n0