sers/federicodelsanto/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicodelsanto/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/federicodelsanto","id":222039733,"login":"federicodelsanto","node_id":"U_kgDODTwOtQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicodelsanto/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicodelsanto/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicodelsanto/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicodelsanto/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicodelsanto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicodelsanto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/13b5e42bdbb6fce8f4bd65a3879f5a34849787dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:12:29Z","email":"federico.delsanto@varda.ag","name":"federicodelsanto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:12:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: update 4e-analytical-methodology-table.csv (#809)\n\n6 rows previously logged as kPa=X, cm water head=..., bar=..., pF=...\n(WoSIS-style) were relabeled to the equivalent matric potential = Y hPa\nformat already used for the Austrian dataset:\n\nkPa=6 → 60 hPa\nkPa=10 → 100 hPa\nkPa=33 → 330 hPa (new — no hPa equivalent existed before)\nkPa=100 → 1000 hPa\nkPa=200 → 2000 hPa\nkPa=500 → 5000 hPa\nkPa=1500 → 15000 hPa\n\nAlso deleted the 6 now duplicate rows that had these hPa labels (60,\n100, 1000, 2000, 5000, 15000 hPa), since they''re now covered by the\nrelabeled rows above.","tree":{"sha":"137f211a14eea2dcbf2e2e958c627abaf3940641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/137f211a14eea2dcbf2e2e958c627abaf3940641"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/13b5e42bdbb6fce8f4bd65a3879f5a34849787dd","verif