90554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oleksiivarda","id":132890554,"login":"oleksiivarda","node_id":"U_kgDOB-u_ug","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oleksiivarda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/commits/f1f8b8131ec1627b3c6cd7baf79f2e86e888177e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:16:09Z","email":"132890554+oleksiivarda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Oleksii"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T15:16:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: sp-5571 - date formats with datepicker for date fields on metadata (#802)\n\n- PublicationDateRow component was renamed to the DateRow.\n- DateRow component was extended to handle YYYY | YYYY-MM | YYYY-MM-DD\ndate formats with format switcher next to the input field\n- Reference dates on the metadata form were updated to use DateRow\ncomponent\n\nPS: Right now Publication date supports only full date format on the BE\nside, so it will throw an error when the user will try to save YYYY |\nYYYY-MM date formats for the publication date.\n\n<img width=\"1098\" height=\"579\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-21 at 10 07 56\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d3884c8-dac0-4747-b8ec-9086a4a9d292\"\n/>","tree":{"sha":"c5d122ff4a79e1915a2b4610c97f9354506fc9c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/c5d122ff4a79e1915a2b4610c97f9354506fc9c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/f1f8b8131ec1627b3c6cd7baf79f2e86e888177e","verification":{"payload":"tree c5d122ff4a79e1915a2b4610c97f9354506fc9c3\nparent ae8e83a8a74e89f34fd60c3171d4e9cdf9e1398a\nauthor Oleksii <132890554+oleksiivarda@users.noreply.github.com> 1787584569 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787584569 +0200\n\nfeat: sp-5571 - date formats with datepicker for date fields on metadata (#802)\n\n- PublicationDateRow component was renamed to the DateRow.\n- DateRow component was extended to handle YYYY | YYYY-MM | YYYY-MM-DD\ndate formats with format switcher next to the input field\n- Reference dates on the metadata form were updated to use DateRow\ncomponent\n\nPS: Right now Publication date supports only full date format on the BE\nside, so it will throw an error when the user will try to save YYYY |\nYYYY-MM date formats for the publication date.\n\n<img width=\"1098\" height=\"579\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-21 at 10 07 56\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7d3884c8-dac0-4747-b8ec-9086a4a9d292\"\n/>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjGA5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4rkQAA0dghz8sYDztMec3V/GGrAj\nmCAmlop6p/K1DcZ8Yija3+QKZ37yeTm0quGAy9fjGMM0DUMCP/viIEaLwYPkv34e\nMAlkVZx+SsuXy3uUBy5U+8Z0vZIjJzhRh/vGgDCvIlM1elsCFlUSHrIVrViD3YGg\n8kO2JXjuK4d6oDvgooBpU1Hbpc+GQyfkT1RQGRZJnp9S0hOIcHlCxCi+5HIZPQiR\nAd8YBLIq6sno0nQSDAunUnSlUDlZQigB6i1bR92yJUn9stO0Rnkh4PW1vpcL9oA2\nTNzeS6pizwWmPYv6zQ65HbbDC4o/vxizYdXzyLB7mWUnMpEAWtBVOM3/EpgxSN2B\nan5uAeIsXHVN+hti4ulxwp0SNWIm3nAYUPF3ZBm3edz47BL47K5OztK17Cv42Ndz\nlPOYS8xoI5X2kjkfgvqY//Vm/JOxiK56z/He9hlw1/BQ95oR71ylhtcZAyNZxhgn\nro/p7wA4cGGUaVm1pO5bsdn4a8AUQ1hrT1VJuB8yagZj38GmwZwGvXqmYS+4O8Uu\n774KDLblf9dHO1q0od+eAD+4sjsAaeiXQUf2DXFvdwHdK4a4O0a05aik+jvOdvhd\nCdX