lace to start is the doc explaining how to build a\nplugin: [plugin\ndevelopment](https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/blob/feature/sp-5541-share-map-component-with-plugins/docs/frontend/plugin-development.md)\n\nMost of the work has been done in the\n[Map](https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/blob/feature/sp-5541-share-map-component-with-plugins/frontend/src/components/Map/SoilhiveMap.tsx)\ncomponent in order to, mainly, remove all the dependencies from\nprimereact","tree":{"sha":"bebef4952a3fe483ee82b069451c13f75c297afa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/bebef4952a3fe483ee82b069451c13f75c297afa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/7f6252037e12be82a9607f97bc265af015394fc7","verification":{"payload":"tree bebef4952a3fe483ee82b069451c13f75c297afa\nparent 81f5aa0f091f20887ea45555840cc0b3d900df31\nauthor VardAlb <alberto.arpini@varda.ag> 1786970807 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786970807 +0200\n\nfeat(fe): sp-5541 share map component with plugins (#789)\n\nThis PR aim is to allow a plugin to use the same `Map` component used by\nthe host application.\n\nI think the best place to start is the doc explaining how to build a\nplugin: [plugin\ndevelopment](https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/blob/feature/sp-5541-share-map-component-with-plugins/docs/frontend/plugin-development.md)\n\nMost of the work has been done in the\n[Map](https://github.com/varda-ag/soilhive-core/blob/feature/sp-5541-share-map-component-with-plugins/frontend/src/components/Map/SoilhiveMap.tsx)\ncomponent in order to, mainly, remove all the dependencies from\nprimereact","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgwK3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5vgQAILFt+7kRDfFM43yaK/NAgL2\nk1QmO++V3/eJ37pw9s5HjRyND6QUyqGAkeOggMmCaj8DCsMPkPKpb13imwmWe0Rv\nkR5ziSB9ykSRB4CHx8u1JEshryHR9rBRQccP0ELK2YP1TBnPOEECDoVvTbceZH30\nmCYKY9rp0EtesCAC2fG/qwYAkMlt9L5CBrlX7urdVOYJR+xh/wWSAfUwQQOgkjQg\n6PqwWY1gL