77)\n\nImplements: \n- Removes raster re-projection on load, adds optional parameter to\nre-project export output (if not provided, vector data exports in 4326\nand raster in each layer original CRS)\n- `fileToDB`: remove branching to account for mapping not present when\nrunning the job, now throws an error if mapping doesn''t exist. This\nfixes a current bug that avoids loading data columns that are wrongly\ninferred in file''s `metadata.detected_fields`.\n- UI: set `delete_source_files` to false in bulk-load for traceability.","tree":{"sha":"ba5aecb31c05d088c9d34b077a8ca7c77202a220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/ba5aecb31c05d088c9d34b077a8ca7c77202a220"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/4c187016f8413573bc58efac9548a54dbdcb8b7c","verification":{"payload":"tree ba5aecb31c05d088c9d34b077a8ca7c77202a220\nparent c1b0838656cfbdd9528c5b27c70f89f8d87926c1\nauthor Daria Ruiz-Ogarrio Marassanova <daria.marassanova@varda.ag> 1786630576 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786630576 +0200\n\nfeat: remove CRS raster standardization from load, apply on export (#777)\n\nImplements: \n- Removes raster re-projection on load, adds optional parameter to\nre-project export output (if not provided, vector data exports in 4326\nand raster in each layer original CRS)\n- `fileToDB`: remove branching to account for mapping not present when\nrunning the job, now throws an error if mapping doesn''t exist. This\nfixes a current bug that avoids loading data columns that are wrongly\ninferred in file''s `metadata.detected_fields`.\n- UI: set `delete_source_files` to false in bulk-load for traceability.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfdGwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxh0QAFLIdE2mMSC+cKgwWYqZyq8w\nV354HC0zxwae5iS44xkO2IWxt+GMc4ndUln3bcRO9Mq6hISCgxwNa/GappazazQL\nE/b71qOhSDDCW/5q+N82IbJuJ/3QS1X02jmByqyQOSneFLjp98W2Njh8qd72s/ER\nvDPDm7Kfr8LP+t7/hPqdOUgmgkVz6FsNDg/YXuyI0x+/5z+rm