comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T08:37:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: sp-5441 start raster ingest job (#773)\n\nWIP don''t merge yet because there is a bug when unmapping a mapped file\nand then continue mapping (error from the job due to data_mapping being\nempty). Update: Dasha will update the job code so that it ignores empty\ndata_mappings because if I instead deleted them I wouldn''t then be able\nto remove them from dataset-file-mappings because as of today there\nisn''t a way to PATCH a dataset-file-mapping''s mappingId back to \"unset\".\n\nIf instead you never unmap any file and you start the raster ingestion\nit will go fine.","tree":{"sha":"c62f5fd7d8157ad63f4916d9dac94a701cc7dac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/trees/c62f5fd7d8157ad63f4916d9dac94a701cc7dac1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/varda-ag/soilhive-core/git/commits/d6791d454ab2632044450b4e04b3bc09dcc3e2e0","verification":{"payload":"tree c62f5fd7d8157ad63f4916d9dac94a701cc7dac1\nparent 84b0c3144beb5b7aac7760e27bdb366b70277dcc\nauthor cristbello <153092107+cristbello@users.noreply.github.com> 1786091827 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786091827 +0200\n\nfeat: sp-5441 start raster ingest job (#773)\n\nWIP don''t merge yet because there is a bug when unmapping a mapped file\nand then continue mapping (error from the job due to data_mapping being\nempty). Update: Dasha will update the job code so that it ignores empty\ndata_mappings because if I instead deleted them I wouldn''t then be able\nto remove them from dataset-file-mappings because as of today there\nisn''t a way to PATCH a dataset-file-mapping''s mappingId back to \"unset\".\n\nIf instead you never unmap any file and you start the raster ingestion\nit will go fine.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdZkzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6XEQAKD1+7KEyXbvFdOSThFKfjIb\n3nfT5qjDON3kS/Dm5LsoY06EjnDbOOvuM8iLBO1XvsiBE