/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/b85aee1696c461c543f3841d297de01ee5b0a309/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:38:38Z","email":"65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KinfeMichael Tariku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T06:38:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(router): prepare production slot matching inputs (#1849)\n\n* perf(router): prepare production slot matching inputs\n\nReuse fixed-route preparation and cache specificity outside the request path. Preserve descriptor grouping, prefix checks, stable precedence, native URL errors and complete catch-all matching. Add regression coverage, real browser checks and an isolated paired diagnostic. Refs #1770.\n\n* test(router): exercise slot matching across dev and production","tree":{"sha":"d4e3f65e908f089fbf0c95c0f5caf1a1860c9c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/d4e3f65e908f089fbf0c95c0f5caf1a1860c9c7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/b85aee1696c461c543f3841d297de01ee5b0a309","verification":{"payload":"tree d4e3f65e908f089fbf0c95c0f5caf1a1860c9c7d\nparent 8fe0b1ce123becf8c489444df4353ae9c8870358\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791441518 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791441518 -0700\n\nperf(router): prepare production slot matching inputs (#1849)\n\n* perf(router): prepare production slot matching inputs\n\nReuse fixed-route preparation and cache specificity outside the request path. Preserve descriptor grouping, prefix checks, stable precedence, native URL errors and complete catch-all matching. Add regression coverage, real browser checks and an isolated paired diagnostic. Refs #1770.\n\