de:\n''teams 1.0.2 → 1.1.0 has 3 change(s) to its tables that are not applied\nyet. Run farm teams migrate to review them.''\n\nit plans exactly what migrate would print, read-only, and is never\nawaited: startup cannot be delayed (tested against a database that never\nanswers). each plugin is bounded by a timeout and errors are silent, left\nto farm schema check. the module is loaded only when some plugin or\nintegration owns tables, so other apps pay nothing.","tree":{"sha":"4bda33dc933b3b7d52f235d14b4a8d403e6b8617","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/4bda33dc933b3b7d52f235d14b4a8d403e6b8617"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/e102ad09764a0cfde71825611727d12d120e2944","verification":{"payload":"tree 4bda33dc933b3b7d52f235d14b4a8d403e6b8617\nparent 224e44b1017c333e2307379dcb40b9eeedb212d7\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791347059 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791347059 -0700\n\nfeat(dev): mention unapplied plugin table changes when the dev server starts (#1838)\n\nonce farm dev is up, one line per plugin whose tables have changes\nfarm <plugin> migrate would apply, such as an installed upgrade:\n''teams 1.0.2 → 1.1.0 has 3 change(s) to its tables that are not applied\nyet. Run farm teams migrate to review them.''\n\nit plans exactly what migrate would print, read-only, and is never\nawaited: startup cannot be delayed (tested against a database that never\nanswers). each plugin is bounded by a timeout and errors are silent, left\nto farm schema check. the module is loaded only when some plugin or\nintegration owns tables, so other apps pay nothing.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxclzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAANYQADxIe4xsmFYFpcT7PV3ovAz+\nzxhJov/4IIpUhEiQVhcrMyDk1OotcpygY5BVe7uAVRoiuHi61QFRDWNSjNP9Nv7A\nMc4vbzP7B6CXJJD7tWkFQcBjQTJ22o49l+ZPRrYrGrHvxXv0coswn9/kP6dJunD8\no1DOBkOl5Q2SFv09+82ggTP2bGazBJbSl86GCEc