l":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/5a1ea9b0826d3f720724b76f0a7fdc78630a85d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:13:57Z","email":"65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KinfeMichael Tariku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:13:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(agent): opt-in noindex for preview deployments (#1818)\n\nagent.noindexPreviews sends X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow on every\nresponse from farm''s server when the deployment is a preview: an\nexplicit FARM_PREVIEW, VERCEL_ENV=preview, netlify deploy-preview or\nbranch-deploy, or a render pull request preview. Off by default.\n\nthe provider env checks telemetry already used move into\ndeployment-environment.ts next to the new preview check. netlify only\nexposes its context to the build, so the build''s answer rides into the\nserver bundle, and a runtime FARM_PREVIEW still wins. dev registers a\nsmall middleware so FARM_PREVIEW=1 farm dev marks every response.\n\nCloses #1797","tree":{"sha":"5a5f1c79851cc7c5326581450f479877d6ca1438","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/5a5f1c79851cc7c5326581450f479877d6ca1438"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/5a1ea9b0826d3f720724b76f0a7fdc78630a85d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a5f1c79851cc7c5326581450f479877d6ca1438\nparent 72576bd074f868d43494e4a841223c0b2c450ace\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791324837 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791324837 -0700\n\nfeat(agent): opt-in noindex for preview deployments (#1818)\n\nagent.noindexPreviews sends X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow on every\nresponse from farm''s server when the deployment is a preview: an\nexplicit FARM_PREVIEW, VERCEL_ENV=preview, netlify deploy-preview or\nbranch-deploy, or a render pull request preview. Off by default.\n\nthe provider env checks telemetry already used move into\ndeployment-environment.ts next to the new preview check. netlify only\nexposes its context to the build, so the build''s answer rides into the\nserver bundle, and a runtime FARM_PREVIEW still wins. dev registers a\nsmall middleware so FARM_PREVIEW=1 farm dev marks every response.\n\nCloses #1797","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxXKlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2tMQAA7c09Z/XBBZ1l5dZ614ZRtN\nGNR0zfgsTWqdHqnDonOVbsvA1+xoX5KRIwu3vSX6gqe/f0cO/l2JMoJvVmtrIugy\niCuz8IaoHtN2J0c+OWlnixpx9uf4xO1mdlFmjxxwXaIwB+/zKPho07DYpzCJLFzO\nYDD55S491VqApsMGNa7tMJElxCqY523oSptY2wXktBQ2mShuIoNQ5buDCQvJIZbR\nM+JwM5VhcFrtLFN4/cJ9Dmyj8raYUj5ycxjFwMClNXGHgZ+TBSZ9ngnwJRMGBaBQ\ne4Js1thIDseEzvfYWRta/ny+pb3f9Y59CLTT92HaPxpP//ra84te3nAE6zoWwexJ\nTguGaoUypJv3+ds6OF0ePCPJT6XYm8Jd81yKXL5o9j9FybwDalKPzsNrA+Nm2Lk/\n7utm99BDZvaKnaD5X4xSgaxlW5I0Y/F1cc0tNJ6/ABrvysFsR4VHaEaVHysvA0TL\nAu1sWDExe+Ryg4/xEaY2dbng3dnOIm9a+oIF3riagJdDwORXGTh+uKwxxSKMUOa0\ntEUb6KbXJoY1v7tWiF9KnzWixfSgF/nTe3pD/pPoSzjo4IbMOvc5OMGGhkgxcvMN\ncZSCPbAo/RuB213Xaoblhc/WBZ4/y4O13VEEtCvv/q2bzL5aE0TB+DAsjZC8O6xi\n9uyw/bVBF1S5OvSgz6hj\n=XoEH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T22:13:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","re