vatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65047246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kinfe123","id":65047246,"login":"Kinfe123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDQ3MjQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/86010619c40782461172ee36e2a20f8b3f14ebd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:08:41Z","email":"65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KinfeMichael Tariku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T22:08:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(site): sitemap for farmjs.dev marketing pages (#1811)\n\n* fix(site): sitemap for farmjs.dev marketing pages\n\nthe docs engine answers /sitemap.xml with docs pages only. serve the landing, agents and blog pages at /sitemap-site.xml through a programmatic route, and add a robots.ts that lists both sitemaps once an app''s robots.ts can take /robots.txt from the docs engine (#1808).\n\n* fix(site): serve the site sitemap at /sitemap-site\n\na dotted final segment in a programmatic api route makes its virtual module id end in .xml and the production build fails to detect its language. an extensionless root url keeps the sitemap at the root, where it can list every url on the site.","