ithub.com/users/Kinfe123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/7b3e2b562c30e7fb9608e96de6c7931df424891f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:32:36Z","email":"65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KinfeMichael Tariku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:32:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(docs-engine): an app''s own sitemap and robots take precedence (#1813)\n\nwith docs enabled, a root sitemap.ts, robots.ts, llms.ts, or llms-full.ts\n(or the same file in public/) takes its path from the docs engine, which\nkeeps serving the rest. notes that an app sitemap replaces the docs one\ninstead of extending it.\n\nCloses #1791","tree":{"sha":"99a2b7232df8a4ef9fb3f22b5dfc5bd840d001d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/99a2b7232df8a4ef9fb3f22b5dfc5bd840d001d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/7b3e2b562c30e7fb9608e96de6c7931df424891f","verification":{"payload":"tree 99a2b7232df8a4ef9fb3f22b5dfc5bd840d001d6\nparent 32adea38ffcba9924a5d17ce01c555703b4442c6\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791322356 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791322356 -0700\n\ndocs(docs-engine): an app''s own sitemap and robots take precedence (#1813)\n\nwith docs enabled, a root sitemap.ts, robots.ts, llms.ts, or llms-full.ts\n(or the same file in public/) takes its path from the docs engine, which\nkeeps serving the rest. notes that an app sitemap replaces the docs one\ninstead of extending it.\n\nCloses #1791","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxWj0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAl