 list moves into getFarmAppOwnedDocsEnginePaths and now\nalso hands /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt to the app when it has a root\nsitemap or robots metadata route. apps without them get the same\ngenerated code as before.\n\nPart of #1791","tree":{"sha":"64e5f8628736979ccd78f279a392a4cc0e6d2cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/64e5f8628736979ccd78f279a392a4cc0e6d2cc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/32adea38ffcba9924a5d17ce01c555703b4442c6","verification":{"payload":"tree 64e5f8628736979ccd78f279a392a4cc0e6d2cc2\nparent fa74780dd17a09375bb19b0755eb390901f6652b\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791322341 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791322341 -0700\n\nfix(docs): let an app''s own sitemap.ts and robots.ts win over the docs engine in production builds (#1808)\n\nwith docs enabled, the production entry called the docs handler before\napp metadata routes and only skipped it for /llms.txt and /llms-full.txt,\nso a root sitemap.ts or robots.ts never ran.\n\nthe exclusion list moves into getFarmAppOwnedDocsEnginePaths and now\nalso hands /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt to the app when it has a root\nsitemap or robots metadata route. apps without them get the same\ngenerated code as before.\n\nPart of #1791","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxWjlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/LIQAHHjDdyvFxhpZqEnqfivw2ZE\nOzpvRk3GH4IzkY1L5SgAK1+nuvSNh4FcR/hLjITdir7YkXpafJtalWpsdi1YwTcj\n6gab195SItXDXy2k5656SBgHDh4s3+ki3tOXslKqJ6iBzaDut9nc8+uE748I08+x\nf/8R28YLuGkuk5Gx1ScEWjfNJlKz1MKOj4gWwYBIb9Yz9H7PXNJj9hTiV2wBw+Pg\nZ+dBFocKHoN0tptgQkvUoP5KRnrY3UQwoHvGAk3kV4dyBQQn/5/MyHemPnD0mee7\n8wlQYR1pHrZuPO1mzQAYw+l8pVfop9+49qIJOM2m09JvUDa0rulq97vrhSkHgnaO\nltGWQj78YhL1wnbNwd1u6hdYFaH6bIoYJ64kPI8CtO3dvSmjQp5sDJZ+PTLErQo+\n7fxHKFkR4hqsKhzPLJWv20+X3bsraGS3y48whWrIRj/fK81blnxTujs7wOoFosaD\nTNc459rSqZAHJKp3v9OZYMdBuHueU1BITSQIOuRLA4x6XHxCJuxmL12X5zDT1UGa\