:"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/55e95f58932f8e0f0d635af29adfb83d0d79e81e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:02:08Z","email":"65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KinfeMichael Tariku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:02:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(i18n): emit absolute hreflang alternate urls (#1816)\n\nhreflang alternates were bare paths (/fr/pricing), which search engines\nignore. both the dev renderer and the nitro runtime now build them through\none helper that resolves each href against the route''s metadataBase, or the\nrequest origin when there is none. forwarded host/proto only count under\nserver.trustProxy, the same rule as every other request url.\n\nppr shell keys include that origin when i18n prefix routing is on, so a\nshell with one host''s alternates is never served to another host.\n\nCloses #1790","tree":{"sha":"0dcf27e71da88fdb7d900f6998a04a6f4bc3bb58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/0dcf27e71da88fdb7d900f6998a04a6f4bc3bb58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/55e95f58932f8e0f0d635af29adfb83d0d79e81e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0dcf27e71da88fdb7d900f6998a04a6f4bc3bb58\nparent 8af8f7d332edd70fa6993dd7d1b77565631bb77d\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791320528 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791320528 -0700\n\nfix(i18n): emit absolute hreflang alternate urls (#1816)\n\nhreflang alternates were bare paths (/fr/pricing), which search engines\nignore. both the dev renderer and the nitro runtime now build them through\none helper that resolves each href against the route''s metadataBase, or the\nrequest origin when there is none. forwarded host/proto only count under\nserver.trustProxy, the same rule as every other request url.\n\nppr shell keys include that origin when i18n prefix routing is on, so a\nshell with one host''s alternates is never served to another host.\n\nCloses #1790","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxWHQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA634QAFEmf1eEvsRLm+smuX8g9QYF\nn+LgpyISgxHi/URZ9U9reh5nFM6XTV/ridH3K8gDoo8RDq0yrkdMELbOToc74sQv\nMFUu+6hQOTNUevjarfcfeNMlLSsVvIEfuex4BSwH8TAAfvCOVJS5NYsbkK7DSadc\n7AY5+bctGe0tUvDpErS1GlXHB1QGktX1bm6TV3YPvmov8BdxhY4bGdY1K2iZGWph\n86fHx7lSLqlViNr+kCDIGMl2OyPINGDl3y9h14/KXCU45hsJ+XUTXGFUcmQHrCTJ\nqYW1iNH8N/6aYnA+m/e+t781xNT38PdvDaX6yl8Pc6mP5+t+yY+3xp+3Bt3W/KHu\nErmbwY73vtmtQPhsrnMBFmFNB2/AawZXRns1s2pKYlxLIttGNIQUu3hEZnOE3f2O\niqJLHcwj4BoZ3sdiqj4AGEXh0Z/DpdEFDchE7JVDEW/hQV3dnZj3HJ/iO/Dg3bxG\nOCLRTWEAj3uEKKK94isXabv3uTTdnO/9gsm4bJOR9BLIF4GARnHB496VFb2cj8k2\nA++Tr37r2kKAZLE6LXPFeBNjNFd27JnyUHLcNX/ocWEESuhnHqpNwDzY9FBz8xOU\nGNVvXDwApu3vl5KNGvhY2Sv+oE9Y6eac3h7kWGaq4sCB2wMt4EjoM5izoH6BC7BC\nGb4gvF0qRvNLtXuMyIvz\n=7Ixy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T21:02:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/farming-labs/farm.js/commit/55e95f58932f8e0f0d635af29adfb83d0d79e81e","node_id":"C_kwDOQAkI0toAKDU1ZTk1ZjU4OTMyZjhlMGYwZDYzNWFmMjlhZGZiODNkMGQ3OWU4MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/farming-labs/farm.js/commit/8af8f7d332edd70fa6993dd7d1b77565631bb77d","sha":"8af8f7d332edd70fa6993dd7d1b77565631bb77d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/8af8f7d332edd70fa6993dd7d1b77565631bb77d"}],"sha":"55e95f58932f8e0f0d635af29adfb83d0d79e81e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/55e95f58932f8e0f0d635af29adfb83d0d79e81e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65047246?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kinfe123","id":65047246,"login":"Kinfe123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDQ3MjQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kinfe123","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/commits/8af8f7d332edd70fa6993dd7d1b77565631bb77d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:52:53Z","email":"65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com","name":"KinfeMichael Tariku"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:52:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(schema): real foreign keys between plugins, only where safe (#1789)\n\na reference to a table another plugin creates becomes a foreign key when\nthe table is in the same database, the referenced column is its primary key\nor unique, and the types match:\n\n- created inline with the table when the other plugin''s table already\n  exists, so farm schema migrate (dependencies first) gets it in one run\n- otherwise the table is created without it and migrate says to run farm\n  schema migrate\n- never added to an existing table automatically: with\n  schema.allowForeignKeys, rows pointing at nothing are counted first and\n  the key is added only when there are none (not possible on sqlite)\n- never on the app''s own tables, or for enforced: app/none references\n- cross-plugin keys are optional for drift: neither their presence nor\n  their absence is reported as drift; farm schema check warns about keys\n  an existing table could have","tree":{"sha":"93ce33403a6d18f675dbd4c4cc1254c60360c20e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/93ce33403a6d18f675dbd4c4cc1254c60360c20e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/8af8f7d332edd70fa6993dd7d1b77565631bb77d","verification":{"payload":"tree 93ce33403a6d18f675dbd4c4cc1254c60360c20e\nparent 9605fee5a54d4b5c7bc95254ba4f5b90e64ca67a\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791319973 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791319973 -0700\n\nfeat(schema): real foreign keys between plugins, only where safe (#1789)\n\na reference to a table another plugin creates becomes a foreign key when\nthe table is in the same database, the referenced column is its primary key\nor unique, and the types match:\n\n- created inline with the table when the other plugin''s table already\n  exists, so farm schema migrate (dependencies first) gets it in one run\n- otherwise the table is created without it and migrate says to run farm\n  schema migrate\n- never added to an existing table automatically: with\n  schema.allowForeignKeys, rows pointing at nothing are counted first and\n  the key is added only when there are none (not possible on sqlite)\n- never on the app''s own tables, or for enforced: app/none references\n- cross-plugin keys are optional for drift: neither their presence nor\n  their absence is reported as drift; farm schema check warns about keys\n  an existing table could have","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxV+lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX+AQAK2RM7QEWT6K2iQy1/q3hmyN\nlBKfaW2cJu/4cahEl15eN4Ex+1ydkW85akD0XaxWh7FpDwJCdy5D+Eor2QrzxE+m\nF2iBWYfvXzr+q7KWUk6VfQtcJ/S5PnvuCOPord0AZYRwmD3YTq9GiuqNxMRAPFsn\nC+RyVNmD8Aq91hXHLWinuBBpSPbsf1saW6glyWaluvPAUhtlOfTCtT5sP4s6dixZ\niZ+1gdHvjtgQX7eJgLGB3SJckRUNQ0abYzNRGMnpCc4YaNjNY+bwys9RQHcOBp6f\nGYGljQXfZ7/G9YjfTti4FqhSULBc+stBBTpm+ty0K9z5me/D9alyotA14k7ff+Om\nUzvNn++d8f6C1lsEs4t9IBq5ILgb6292ztzK3h0oI90MDc4ARKI3fpmdsaH79mLh\nQAT66fhiqCSZa5uzjVtBIdifuOyjZkNH5baeGrR/5OSLk2T/mHNMbsd0XZLCSmAa\n+YaaHnOLEcWFm9VnOIwFo6S5mFaGrfn07/J0NUXPkt3IWb6/Ilz2fsCQjkQj3/c+\nMPK13AnExzD/d/yx52jEe5Uv8iWXZiwi8x3PTiM0qgYQMdcwvKT4ytbwbTIneC7o\nTapq2MUd0+5ucGq0P0pZiK4OwdxhZVMT3Q/YkoJrzx5Co/aNBW48ZwQDZIeTZBrz\nGNLUaCXAHp76oNPCyJVk\n=qOxU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T20:52:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user