es and extensions\nbetween plugins). each step is the same code as farm <plugin> migrate, so\nflags, approvals and prisma/drizzle handling match. when a plugin fails,\nplugins depending on it are skipped, the rest still run, and the command\nexits 1 listing what did not finish. --write produces one ordered file.\nthe app''s own migrations are not run here.","tree":{"sha":"04dcecbfd995ac62204d48a336d61e043bf9bd7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/04dcecbfd995ac62204d48a336d61e043bf9bd7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/4796254575db1cb575a30a59c28db4ae75fce010","verification":{"payload":"tree 04dcecbfd995ac62204d48a336d61e043bf9bd7f\nparent f273ff458b26757cc9211351427841a7a55aa77f\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791312742 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791312742 -0700\n\nfeat(cli): migrate every plugin''s tables in dependency order (#1788)\n\nfarm schema migrate [--apply] [--write file] runs each plugin''s migration\nin dependency order (from dependsOn and from references and extensions\nbetween plugins). each step is the same code as farm <plugin> migrate, so\nflags, approvals and prisma/drizzle handling match. when a plugin fails,\nplugins depending on it are skipped, the rest still run, and the command\nexits 1 listing what did not finish. --write produces one ordered file.\nthe app''s own migrations are not run here.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxUNmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGc4QAJ3n1vhbUfanM2emIk/rGBX+\nwZFcBt5hB/xQH+HDna21rtPK7brwMUwhEJxP/ij4O49WGgNbyDtHrNDsQmVNKea3\nBVqxAcjIMGaQmVO+aIYLP0GP1Q09rL7jqzBa0qJAxaL030i5b+KQXXI1mpXeOffa\n46k3etDSyAatrDcyAs+muUGs32Xfv36fhH8d4nQlcOevtSG+oYlRAIUF8RC8AefP\npoWJ6MY5DPVF09QtqgKavVSXsgkplCxodUE3yL/krhGlAzMP/M8G9BgXk88l3hfC\nG4QimGpZMqvqaY8dv294H+CUUSB4UK0AxDkeczBamHmnUojWrwJGrvVu0KXPC6GP\n5eev9qBn/aq5UwGDZAxyu89KPMhoi1ifE6OfGLYeysmO8zIq4DBcge1nuLPCokQj\ne7xZ