red dependencies form a cycle\n- dependencies between table owners are also inferred: a reference to, or\n  columns added to, a table another plugin creates\n- farm schema check lists owners dependencies first and shows what each\n  needs, as in billing (plugin, postgres, needs teams)\n- collectSchemaDependencies and orderSchemaOwners are exported for the\n  migrate-everything command that comes next","tree":{"sha":"6f8dd2947dc25dc8eb42a8f2e0c16cbfbf073489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/trees/6f8dd2947dc25dc8eb42a8f2e0c16cbfbf073489"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/farming-labs/farm.js/git/commits/66345c1b2d7f0ec3dcc6789fe42076769f56ce3e","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f8dd2947dc25dc8eb42a8f2e0c16cbfbf073489\nparent d2a31a4180ee06e415cfb7be5cc333ae179be79c\nauthor KinfeMichael Tariku <65047246+Kinfe123@users.noreply.github.com> 1791311726 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791311726 -0700\n\nfeat(plugin): declare plugin dependencies and infer them from schemas (#1787)\n\n- definePlugin({ dependsOn }) names plugins (full or short name) or\n  integration keys this plugin needs. the config fails to load when one is\n  missing, a plugin lists itself, or declared dependencies form a cycle\n- dependencies between table owners are also inferred: a reference to, or\n  columns added to, a table another plugin creates\n- farm schema check lists owners dependencies first and shows what each\n  needs, as in billing (plugin, postgres, needs teams)\n- collectSchemaDependencies and orderSchemaOwners are exported for the\n  migrate-everything command that comes next","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxT9uCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApxQQAEHA6bcRlR8QbLdL49SxItf0\n3zFC5ywJWazK+Ya/ZCu7J1eWql94c64RnKRpTa9Z5+hA2H1Jpy9qJfQy+lbYJk99\n1Nu8IlZpHcfyMHmiU3IAEtJFynyrxlEp7qWthAgURX2ZGixiy7BSovOhnN6MReLU\nab4uwe/mwd1xxRLAeYsfvqeF/BGfz0YfmiCPUlEoq5YGeSoxaSVgTqxBTSo3qsq8\n6Plo1YSD0XerSMq5kCZFbkDHaR6XJvOawFOBNa/yg9SNd/