9 to faab2be, the\nmaster commit of 2026-10-04. Upstream f5e91aa removed the armv7 and Node 20\njob, and enable-armv7 is now accepted but ignored, with a default of false.\nThe input goes together with the pin move: at the old pin it defaults to\ntrue, so removing it there would have turned the advisory job on.\n\nThe only other workflow change between the two commits is dac6cc9: the\ndesktop and integration jobs replace npm 10.9.x with npm 11 on the Node 22\nrunners. The build-command, test-command, and node-versions inputs keep\ntheir meaning, and the matrix stays Node 22 and 24 on Linux x64, Linux\narm64, macOS, and Windows. engines.node is >=22.0.0, so dropping the armv7\nlane removes no supported target.\n\nThe leftover formatting note now names the format-check-command input it\nexplains, the cspell words that only the armv7 comment needed are gone, and\nthe prepare guard comment in check-package.mjs no longer says the Node 22\nplugin CI lane runs npm 10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08ff1debeaf5e8825d4f69dd624758eb36484622","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/08ff1debeaf5e8825d4f69dd624758eb36484622"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/1bff09e156f96308fa7b46af4582017250bb54bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.git