//api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/8f080fe4b0a4fd1ff65b0ed7d667455822bba1a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:40:00Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:40:00Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"build: make the documentation checks opt-out rather than opt-in\n\nThe Markdown lint and spellcheck scopes were an enumerated list of two\ndirectories, so the dated design memos this repository moved into\ndocs/decisions were unchecked by omission. Nothing in CI said so, and every\nfuture documentation subdirectory would have inherited the same silent gap.\nBoth scopes are recursive now, and the one deliberate exclusion is written\nwhere a reader looking at lint scope will find it: the dated memos are\nhistorical records, kept as written.\n\nFour tool configurations still excluded docs/superpowers, a directory that\nno longer exists. The two that lint Markdown now point at the memos instead;\nthe two that never read Markdown at all drop the entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"d4d2545c51b548427baa11d3988d35d6347104ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/d4d2545c51b548427baa11d3988d35d6347104ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/8f080fe4b0a4fd1ff65b0ed7d667455822bba1a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commit/8f080fe4b0a4fd1ff65b0ed7d667455822bba1a3","node_id":"C_kwDOQApVMtoAKDhmMDgwZmU0YjBhNGZkMWZmNjViMGVkN2Q2Njc0NTU4MjJiYmExYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commit/1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917","sha":"1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917"}],"sha":"8f080fe4b0a4fd1ff65b0ed7d667455822bba1a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/8f080fe4b0a4fd1ff65b0ed7d667455822bba1a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:38:46Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:38:46Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"test(panel): assert the save refusal by what it protects, and leave the theme matrix to the library\n\nThe invalid-row assertion read whether the Save button was disabled, which\npinned the mechanism the shared action bar happens to refuse with rather\nthan the outcome the panel owns. The bar now refuses through aria-disabled\nand leaves the native attribute alone, so the line was checking a different\nattribute than it was written against. It clicks Save instead, past the\nbutton''s own blocked state, and requires that no save reached the host,\nwhich holds for any refusal route the library picks.\n\nThe theme block asserted the same label-to-attribute contract in two shapes\na hundred and fifty lines apart, with one shape''s explanation sitting beside\nthe other, and the five-choice matrix it walked is the library''s contract\nrather than this panel''s. What is left is what this panel owns: a fresh\nprofile follows the host and a chosen theme reaches this panel''s root. The\nlocator is hoisted beside the row helpers, matching the convention the file\nalready set, so a further rename lands in one place.\n\nFour page loads waited for network quiescence and then waited again on an\nexplicit locator. This panel polls status every three seconds and the path\ninventory every thirty, so the idle window was paid for nothing. They wait\nfor the document instead and rely on the locator waits that follow.\n\nThe console listener read and compared the message text for every log,\nwarning, and info the page emitted, when only an error can reach the\nfailure list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"2201dba54ac7f470fc8730a2110cbb0c779ec8a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/2201dba54ac7f470fc8730a2110cbb0c779ec8a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commit/1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917","node_id":"C_kwDOQApVMtoAKDFkMWMwZWJiNDRlOTZmOTQ4Y2NiNDNkZjk3M2I5NjRmYmFkYmQ5MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commit/13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a","sha":"13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a"}],"sha":"1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/1d1c0ebb44e96f948ccb43df973b964fbadbd917"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:37:43Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:37:43Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"test: pin the conversion factory module count\n\nCLAUDE.md states the number of conversion factory modules in three places\nand docs/development.md stated a different one, because both were\ntranscribed by hand and neither was checked. The suite already pins the 83\nruntime conversions the registry expands them into, so the sibling\nassertion makes the source figure checkable too: adding a factory now fails\na gate rather than quietly leaving the prose behind.\n\nThe five modules the count excludes are the registry, the transmit-list\nmodule, and three shared helpers, none of which is a conversion family.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"c8a5243c0291e527c3333172ff2079fbf5f06b1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/c8a5243c0291e527c3333172ff2079fbf5f06b1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commit/13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a","node_id":"C_kwDOQApVMtoAKDEzZTBlMWVmY2EzYmViZmNhZDBmZGRlYWViZjgzOTBlOTE4MjQwNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commit/e95e35fea04d4e93156dc4b105dd3e0f4e56e1d2","sha":"e95e35fea04d4e93156dc4b105dd3e0f4e56e1d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/e95e35fea04d4e93156dc4b105dd3e0f4e56e1d2"}],"sha":"13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/13e0e1efca3bebfcad0fddeaebf8390e9182405a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/e95e35fea04d4e93156dc4b105dd3e0f4e56e1d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:36:19Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T06:36:19Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"refactor(panel): take announcements, reveal, freshness, and counts from the shared controls\n\nThe panel kept its own copy of four things the shared controls already\nprovide, and the 0.11 release put the last of them in the bundle the panel\nloads anyway.\n\nIt mounted a polite and an assertive live region of its own inside a frame\nthat mounts one of each, so the panel carried four regions where two are\nneeded and both extra ones re-rendered on every three second status poll.\nMessages now go through the frame''s announcer, whose regions exist before\nthe first message, which is the property the local pair was written to get.\n\nA jump to a flagged row read the reduced-motion preference off the global\nwindow and then wrote the scroll-then-focus sequence out twice. Both call\nsites now reveal through the shared helper, which feature-detects\nscrollIntoView and reads the preference from the element''s own window.\n\nThe toolbar subtracted its own staleness age, without the clamp that keeps\na server clock running ahead of the browser from reading as a negative age,\nand it counted parent errors by building a throwaway array on every poll.\nThe staleness rule is now the shared one, still driven by the poll clock so\nthe marker moves when a poll lands rather than ticking on its own, and the\nerror tally is folded into the pass the panel already makes over the status\nrows, so a poll walks that list once instead of three times.\n\nThe local pluralizer allocated a fresh regular expression per call, five or\nmore times per render of a component that re-renders on every poll. The\nshared count formatter covers the same cases, so recency.ts is gone and\n\"match\" passes its own plural.\n\nMeasured after the change, the remote is 96,183 gzip bytes, so the baseline\nis re-recorded there. The removals do not offset what the shared helpers\npull in: the build reports 685 KiB of library modules against 252 KiB of\npanel source, and the panel is 120 gzip bytes larger than the figure stamped\nwith the dependency bump, not smaller.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"e41cb0ce7e7d446dad94968a28b3586b5070ce0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/e41cb0ce7e7d446dad94968a28b3586b5070ce0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/e95e35fea04d4e93156dc4b105dd3e0f4e56e1d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://git