ply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"ci: date the plugin-ci pin comment for the commit it names\n\nThe pin moved to master at 5612cf4 but kept the trailing date of the\ncommit it replaced, so the comment claimed a September 2 master for a\nSeptember 13 one. The comment is the only place a reader can see how old\nthe pinned reusable workflow is without resolving the SHA, so a stale\ndate is worse than none. The reusable workflow file itself is byte for\nbyte identical across the twenty commits between the two pins.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"3da8b74d066826b2120cda3b971ea3b8f446d963","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/3da8b74d066826b2120cda3b971ea3b8f446d963"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/2796c18f4a75e1ab8bbbb74360fd7e1b2ac65f4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"http