rlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/873e853028e321db4bbbdf3b46ce46c37f6140a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:19:55Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:19:55Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"docs: bring the source layout and the bundle measurement current\n\nThe development guide''s project structure had drifted from the tree it\ndescribes. It listed five of the nine modules under `src/config/`, missed\nthe conversion metadata builder that lets the catalog be served while the\nplugin is disabled, named three of the six panel hooks, and omitted the\nper-instance option reader and the shared PGN 130306 factory in\n`src/conversions/`. A structure listing is read by someone deciding where\na change belongs, so a module missing from it is a module they will put\nsomewhere else.\n\nThe plugin bundle measurement in CLAUDE.md predates the 1.11.0 range\nguards: `dist/index.mjs` is 325,677 bytes, not 324,343.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"c52d0b397095441910c298adae0d530b80864126","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/c52d0b397095441910c298adae0d530b80864126"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Ne