ws/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/cbce442cdddfed3628a074defd0e415bc4b5762e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:19:46Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:19:46Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"docs: retire the shipped implementation plans and file the design memos\n\nSeven implementation plans were still tracked: the React config panel\nplan, the four Config Advisor phase plans, the advisor settings sub-panel\nplan, and the panel density redesign plan. Every one of them is done, and\na task list that has been carried out describes nothing a reader can act\non. Two of them actively mislead. The OpenRouter phase plans a rationale\nenrichment that was later removed, so the advisor it describes is not the\nadvisor that exists. The React config panel plan targets an ESM\nfederation container loadable only by admin UI 2.27.0 and newer, which is\nthe exact shape issue #8 forced this plugin to revert in 1.6.5, so a\nfuture reader following it would reintroduce a shipped regression.\n\nThe design memos beside them carry the reasoning and stay. They move to\n`docs/decisions/`, which is where the documentation layout puts dated\ndesign-decision memos and where the React config panel design already\nsat, so the whole set now lives in one place and `docs/superpowers/` is\ngone. The React config panel design''s file tree pointed at its own old\npath; it now points at where the file is.\n\nCLAUDE.md records that these memos are historical records rather than\ncurrent documentation, so nobody has to read one to find out.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"ef7355d81ec5ab5db02e9a648c2027b323aad331","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/ef7355d81ec5ab5db02e9a648c2027b323aad331"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/cbce442cdddfed3628a074defd0e415bc4b5762e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ne