rs.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:10:52Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"refactor(panel): move the theme selector to the foot of the panel\n\nThe selector is chrome over the panel rather than one of its tasks, so it\nshould not sit in the sticky toolbar between the catalog search and the\nSetup wizard, where it takes a tab stop ahead of the first setting. The\npreference is shared with every other Signal K plugin panel built on\nthese controls through one storage key, so this panel is not the only\nroute to it, and an operator moving between panels should find it in the\nsame place each time.\n\n`PanelShell` takes `themeToggle=\"end\"`, written out rather than left to\nthe default, so adding a panel title later cannot move the selector\nbetween the title and the content. `PanelToolbar` drops its own\n`ThemeToggle`. The browser check finds the selector by role and name, so\nit follows the move without a change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TrhyiHJbhmfXmLpqFFzeEY","tree":{"sha":"ce9a3d39f83d83464221c22c67ff7a88cdbcd7ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/ce9a3d39f83d83464221c22c67ff7a88cdbcd7ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/ba8e3828f8a5ef73016d09f3f84c00b4c2eed83a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23341701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h