":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/82c47d233c09211856be66602a29ab209482be87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:12:26Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:12:26Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"feat(advisor): flag a fully silent pinned source as a low-confidence stale fix\n\nThe source-pin check previously caught only a conversion whose path had\nmoved to a different live source (high confidence). Extend it to the case\nwhere the pinned source stops publishing entirely and nothing replaces it:\nwhen the path has no live source but QuestDB history shows it within the\nlook-back window, emit the same clear-source recommendation at low\nconfidence and historic origin. Without historic evidence no claim is\nmade, so a history-less dead path is left alone and QuestDB being off\nsuppresses the case rather than nagging on a momentarily idle sensor.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"993ac4953e868bc2dd4d280ed9196b99f2ed0666","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/993ac4953e868bc2dd4d280ed9196b99f2ed0666"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/82c47d233c09211856be66602a29ab209482be87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"ve