https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NearlCrews","id":23341701,"login":"NearlCrews","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzQxNzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NearlCrews","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/commits/39c057822ab45df1897e75c32cbcfc1d276ff81d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T18:35:21Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T18:36:26Z","email":"NearlCrews@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nearl Crews"},"message":"chore(release): 1.8.1\n\nRelease the per-conversion source type and instance overrides with the\none-click Raymarine preset, the temperature-instance runtime fix, and the\nforecast boat-referenced true wind (WIND_WEATHER_TRUE) conversion.\n\nBump the version, add the dated CHANGELOG entry, overwrite the README \"What''s\nnew\" section, document the source-type and instance overrides and the Raymarine\nremap in the PGN reference and troubleshooting guides, refresh the in-range dev\ndependencies, and update the test counts and helper list in the project docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78571d8b65dd37f98a715f10da7df82514ca62ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/trees/78571d8b65dd37f98a715f10da7df82514ca62ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NearlCrews/signalk-nmea2000-emitter-cannon/git/commits/39c057822ab45df1897e75c