ma para nutricionistas e personal trainers): produto, socios,\ncontatos no nicho e conversas com investidores, e mesmo assim engavetado\nno fim de 2025. O que travou foi distribuicao, posicionamento, suporte e\nedge cases do uso real, nao codigo. Linka o post anterior no locale de\nquem le.\n\nCapa: objeto acabado num pedestal num salao vazio, candidata 2 de 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7d4294d65594ff121f9a0d407c01f8c67ff5b89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/f7d4294d65594ff121f9a0d407c01f8c67ff5b89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/fb4e631d14f5e25e9b1b24210061c54e9eacf2eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/fb4e631d14f5e25e9b1b24210061c54e9eacf2eb","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGZiNGU2MzFkMTRmNWUyNWU5YjFiMjQyMTAwNjFjNTRlOWVhY2