cdd78a1ed9de8a6735ad265ae1d05"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/3639a9fd8dd0f3392c41abbce65c8f373c4bd4ad","sha":"3639a9fd8dd0f3392c41abbce65c8f373c4bd4ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/3639a9fd8dd0f3392c41abbce65c8f373c4bd4ad"}],"sha":"5a2a7e094848e1178089194fe7445d11a938e140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/5a2a7e094848e1178089194fe7445d11a938e140"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/3639a9fd8dd0f3392c41abbce65c8f373c4bd4ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T01:05:09Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T01:05:09Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(blog): ordena por data e corrige datePublished invalido\n\nDuas coisas com a mesma causa: nao existia data real, so strings ja\nformatadas por idioma. Entra `publishedAt` em ISO 8601 nos 13 posts.\n\nO bug que estava no ar: o schema.org Article recebia `post.date`, ou\nseja \"16 de abril de 2026\" em pt e \"2026年4月16日\" em jp. Nenhuma das\nduas e parseavel — datePublished exige ISO. Estava assim nos 13 posts\nvezes 5 locales. O `pnpm aeo` nao pega porque verifica se o schema\nexiste, nao se e valido.\n\nA ordenacao sai de featured + order para data desc. A curadoria manual\ntinha marcado featured em exatamente tres posts, todos tag Frontend, e\nfeatured ordena antes de tudo — entao home e busca abriam com\nFrontend, Frontend, Frontend e enterravam arquitetura, pagamentos e IA.\nO oposto do posicionamento de Senior Product Engineer que o resto do\nsite afirma. Topo agora: Arquitetura, Frontend, Frontend.\n\nDesempate por slug, nao pela ordem do readdir: cinco posts dividem\n2026-04-16 e sem criterio estavel a listagem mudaria por maquina.\n\nfeatured e order saem do tipo, do loader e dos JSONs — nenhuma UI lia.\nOs dois testes deles viram tres: ordenacao por data, validade do ISO\n(uma data malformada ordenaria por ultimo em silencio e iria pro\nschema como lixo) e estabilidade do desempate.\n\nVerificado no HTML de producao: datePublished ISO nos 5 locales.\n\nPendente: os cinco posts em 2026-04-16 tem data de importacao, nao de\npublicacao. So o Vinicius sabe as reais.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f223b74d6e476d7c4557d32a40c5e04ffc8668ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/f223b74d6e476d7c4557d32a40c5e04ffc8668ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/3639a9fd8dd0f3392c41abbce65c8f373c4bd4ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/V