epos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/3f4b4394986fe78704b24be123fd1b469f393986/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:50:26Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:50:26Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(blog): post sobre anti-join e backfill na metrica de ativacao\n\nEscrito a partir de dois artigos que ja existem — \"Paga e nunca usou\"\n(Keep) e \"The most uncomfortable number in your customer base\" (Aguiar\nLabs). Nao e traducao nem repost: os dois param na query, e este comeca\nonde eles param. Publicar o mesmo texto aqui faria os dominios\ncompetirem pela mesma busca, e quem perderia e o Keep.\n\nCobre os tres problemas que aparecem ao rodar a metrica de verdade e\nque nenhum dos dois toca:\n\n- O defeito esta no FROM, nao na divisao por zero. A conta que nunca\n  gerou evento nao produz linha nenhuma em events — nao chega no GROUP\n  BY. COALESCE nao resolve linha ausente.\n- NOT IN devolve zero linhas em silencio se algum account_id vier NULL.\n  LEFT JOIN ... IS NULL funciona (o planner reconhece o anti-join), mas\n  e fragil: um filtro sobre a tabela direita no WHERE em vez do ON\n  converte para INNER JOIN e descarta justamente o que se procurava.\n  NOT EXISTS declara a intencao e nao tem esse modo de falha.\n- Backfill impossivel: NULL em first_meaningful_event_at nao distingue\n  \"nunca ativou\" de \"nao instrumentavamos isso ainda\". Por isso a\n  primeira rodada da metrica sempre parece catastrofica.\n\nFecha com a coluna derivada write-once (WHERE ... IS NULL como guarda\nde idempotencia e concorrencia) e com a definicao de uso relevante.\n\nSQL ilustrativo, nao implementacao do Keep. Sem citar cliente. Os cinco\nlocales completos; guard de cobertura i18n passa.\n\nCapa pendente: a conta da OpenAI esta sem credito, entao\n`pnpm blog:cover activation-query-antijoin-backfill` falhou com 429. O\npost renderiza sem ela (cover e derivado da existencia do arquivo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f91de282e90e5ebe79774ba09104c8b092abd98b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/f91de282e90e5ebe79774ba09104c8b092abd98b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/3f4b4394986fe78704b24be123fd1b469f393986","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/3f4b4394986fe78704b24be123fd1b469f393986","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDNmNGI0Mzk0OTg2ZmU3ODcwNGIyNGJlMTIzZmQxYjQ2OWYzOTM5ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621","sha":"6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621"}],"sha":"3f4b4394986fe78704b24be123fd1b469f393986","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/3f4b4394986fe78704b24be123fd1b469f393986"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:28:02Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:28:02Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(projetos): stack real do FastSeller e do X-Drop\n\nDados fornecidos pelo Vinicius — eram os dois unicos projetos sem stack\nfundamentada, entao nada aqui foi inferido.\n\n- FastSeller: Next.js, Go, Kubernetes, NestJS, React, Node.js, AWS,\n  Firebase, PostgreSQL, MongoDB\n- X-Drop: Swift, Next.js, NestJS, Firebase, React, Node.js, Resend\n\nA ordem nao e cosmetica: o card so mostra os 4 primeiros e agrupa o\nresto num \"+N\". Go e Kubernetes vao na frente no FastSeller porque\nReact/Next/Node aparecem em todo projeto e esses dois so ali.\n\n- x-drop/page.tsx: Resend entra na stack nos 5 locales. O resto da lista\n  fica: PostgreSQL, Docker/AWS, Asaas e Mercado Pago estao corroborados\n  pelo case study, a lista passada era so mais curta, nao conflitante.\n- /sobre ganha NestJS, Firebase, Kubernetes e MongoDB. NestJS e Firebase\n  faltavam apesar de centrais em quatro projetos. Go ja estava.\n- llms.txt: mesma adicao, mais Flutter e Resend.\n\nVerificado no HTML de producao: chips visiveis sao\n[Next.js, Go, Kubernetes, NestJS] e [Swift, Next.js, NestJS, Firebase].\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f60d587cfa8bc8e56b2960fa499a660b815b84b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/f60d587cfa8bc8e56b2960fa499a660b815b84b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDZmNWJlMGJkMDk3ZWU3ZjhjNWM2ZDY2ZDcyNGJkZTBhMmYyYWI2MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/5821895751664093589b473e47b4e62edd687615","sha":"5821895751664093589b473e47b4e62edd687615","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/5821895751664093589b473e47b4e62edd687615"}],"sha":"6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/6f5be0bd097ee7f8c5c6d66d724bde0a2f2ab621"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/5821895751664093589b473e47b4e62edd687615/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:20:30Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:20:30Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(deploy): Vercel passa a instalar com pnpm, nao npm\n\nO preview quebrou com \"Cannot read properties of null (reading\n''edgesOut'')\" durante npm install. Causa raiz maior que o sintoma: o\nrepo inteiro e pnpm — CLAUDE.md, pnpm-lock.yaml, CI do GitHub — e so a\nVercel rodava `npm install`, por override no painel. O npm ignora o\npnpm-lock.yaml e resolve a arvore do zero, entao producao nunca usou o\nlockfile commitado. Funcionou ate o sharp entrar na arvore e disparar o\nbug do npm no linux-x64 (local no macOS nao reproduz).\n\n- vercel.json fixa `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`; config no repo\n  ganha do painel\n- package.json#packageManager pina pnpm@10.33.0 como fonte unica das\n  tres pontas\n- workflow perde o `version: 9` do pnpm/action-setup: com packageManager\n  presente, a action erra se as duas versoes forem declaradas. CI passa\n  de pnpm 9 para 10.33.0; o lockfile v9.0 e compartilhado pelas duas e\n  --frozen-lockfile nao o reescreve (verificado)\n- CLAUDE.md documenta as duas coisas\n\nVerificado local: install congelado, typecheck, lint, 30 testes, aeo\n100/100.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f41d4620e0660d0f8b6b891a46897fe7f7dd03b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/f41d4620e0660d0f8b6b891a46897fe7f7dd03b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/5821895751664093589b473e47b4e62edd687615","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events