uiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/5530e7faac8c014169549fad6744b097c99c9abd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:56:09Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:56:09Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(uses): eyebrows numerados e links visiveis\n\n- As 6 categorias viram eyebrows numerados como h2, derivados do indice\n  do map. Sai o ultimo bg-border do projeto: agora sao zero.\n- Links dos itens ganham underline decoration-mu. Eram\n  \"font-medium hover:underline\", ou seja, visualmente identicos ao\n  <span> nao-clicavel ao lado — e 34 dos 36 itens tem URL, entao a\n  pagina inteira parecia texto morto ate passar o mouse.\n- EditorConfigSheet (renderiza nesta pagina): remove shadow-sm, que\n  some no tema escuro, e troca hover:bg-muted por hover:bg-card — muted\n  resolve pra surface, a mesma cor do <pre> atras, entao o botao sumia\n  dentro do bloco de codigo no hover. text-fg/90 -> text-fg.\n\nAEO segue em 100/100.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c161783444e9672413576097b353320ea048f3b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/c161783444e9672413576097b353320ea048f3b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/5530e7faac8c014169549fad6744b097c99c9abd","verificati