+ regua; a secao de topicos\n  expansiveis, que nao tinha cabecalho algum, ganha o 02.\n- Novo card em \"Sistemas de IA em producao\": classificacao de idioma\n  com Claude via Vercel AI SDK, de ~30-40% para <0,1% de respostas no\n  idioma errado. O numero existia so no llms.txt. Anonimizado no padrao\n  da pagina (\"plataforma de customer engagement\").\n- Restos da varredura de identidade: 4x bg-border -> eyebrow, e as duas\n  hover:shadow-md -> hover:border-field (sombra some no tema escuro).\n\nSchema FAQPage intacto: pnpm aeo segue em 100/100.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3ebb38a243239dd2d06bec510e2bd743e9883a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/e3ebb38a243239dd2d06bec510e2bd743e9883a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/c2d542ed9ccc1be8def869c833a4e889c93ee8e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/c2d542ed9ccc1be8def869c833a4e889c93ee8e6","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGMyZDU0MmVkOWNjYzFiZThkZWY4NjljODMzYTRlODg5YzkzZWU4ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/2c0280f70cbc58b9ac4b27bd2d28d53355552ed5","sha":"2c0280f70cbc58b9ac4b27bd2d28d53355552ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/2c0280f70cbc58b9ac4b27bd2d28d53355552ed5"}],"sha":"c2d542ed9ccc1be8def869c833a4e889c93ee8e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/c2d542ed9ccc1be8def869c833a4e889c93ee8e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/2c0280f70cbc58b9ac4b27bd2d28d53355552ed5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:23:27Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:23:27Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(projetos): monograma como placeholder de logo ausente\n\nProjeto sem asset ganha as iniciais na propria ficha, em mono uppercase,\nem vez de nao renderizar ficha nenhuma. Le como decisao de design, nao\ncomo imagem que falhou — e vale para qualquer projeto futuro sem logo,\nem vez de ser remendo pontual na Hora Util.\n\nEntra --color-plate-fg (#0A0A0A), par do --color-plate: a ficha e clara\ne invariante nos dois temas, entao texto sobre ela precisa de um escuro\ninvariante, senao o monograma sumiria no tema escuro.\n\nO componente ProjectLogo passa a concentrar as tres copias que existiam\ndo mesmo bloco — card, modal e busca — que ja haviam divergido: o modal\ntinha ficado com a ficha escura antiga ate hoje de manha.\n\nAs iniciais removem diacriticos: \"Hora Util 360\" renderizava \"HU\" com\nacento no U, o que le como erro de codificacao e nao como inicial.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c277484da79416f4b6ad27e10448a1c7d8899bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/4c277484da79416f4b6ad27e10448a1c7d8899bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/2c0280f70cbc58b9ac4b27bd2d28d53355552ed5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events