iAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/3499d899d3edcbeec29679b5980b715691bcdc73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:15:45Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:15:45Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(sobre): timeline reconstruida a partir do LinkedIn\n\nO repo e o LinkedIn contavam historias diferentes, e o repo subvendia\nem dois pontos: \"Mid-level Software Engineer\" na Holy Solutions, onde o\nLinkedIn diz Full Stack Developer, e \"Product Engineer (Frontend)\" na\nChattie, onde o LinkedIn diz ownership de frontend, backend,\narquitetura e sistemas de IA. Ambos corrigidos.\n\nEntram Aguiar Labs (Senior Software Engineer, contrato, Abr 2025 — Jul\n2026), com Hora Util, X-Drop, MovePro e FastSeller como trabalho de\ncliente; Stealth Startup (Founding Engineer, 2022–2024); e o segundo\ncargo da Easytogo, que estava escondido — a entrada unica cobria o\nperiodo todo com o titulo antigo, apagando a progressao para Software\nEngineer.\n\nSaem Stack Labs, que nao existe no LinkedIn, e MovePro, que la e\ncliente da Aguiar Labs e nao empregadora. Ambas por decisao do Vinicius.\n\nA chave do <li> na timeline passa a incluir o periodo: com dois cargos\nna mesma empresa, company sozinha colidia.\n\nllms.txt reescrito junto — ele ainda listava Stack Labs e MovePro como\nempregadores, \"Mid-level\", \"(Frontend)\" e 100+ empresas. E o arquivo\nque modelos leem para resumir o site, e contradizia a pagina inteira.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"741377365ee21f725b452a24392e6641c0c99b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/741377365ee21f725b452a24392e6641c0c99b62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/3499d899d3edcbeec29679b5980b715691bcdc73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/3499d899d3edcbeec29679b5980b715691bcdc73","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDM0OTlkODk5ZDNlZGNiZWVjMjk2NzliNTk4MGI3MTU2OTFiY2RjNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/8d909de816e06408ffad1c9df54c9ebd042cd61b","sha":"8d909de816e06408ffad1c9df54c9ebd042cd61b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/8d909de816e06408ffad1c9df54c9ebd042cd61b"}],"sha":"3499d899d3edcbeec29679b5980b715691bcdc73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/3499d899d3edcbeec29679b5980b715691bcdc73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/8d909de816e06408ffad1c9df54c9ebd042cd61b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:10:33Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T22:10:33Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(projetos): stack do Vox e do MovePro\n\nAmbas vem de dados que o proprio Vinicius ja tinha registrado em\ndata/experiences.ts, mais o FatSecret que o LinkedIn liga explicitamente\nao MovePro.\n\nFastSeller e X-Drop seguem sem stack: nao existe registro dela em lugar\nnenhum — nem no LinkedIn por projeto, nem no repo. Preencher seria\ninferir a partir da lista guarda-chuva da Aguiar Labs, que cobre cinco\nclientes diferentes.\n\n