":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/03ffce73715396e2ea9835cdd0efa310bedc8ff3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:43:20Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:43:20Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(busca): resultados com capa, destino correto e dobra de acento\n\nSete correcoes na busca, a maioria funcional:\n\nTodo resultado de projeto levava para /projetos, nao para o projeto —\no visitante buscava \"iKropp\", clicava e caia na lista para procurar de\nnovo. Agora vai para detailPage quando existe, senao /projetos#<slug>;\nos cards da grade ganharam id e scroll-mt-20 para a ancora nao parar\ndebaixo do topo.\n\nSem dobra de acento, \"virtualizacao\" nao achava \"virtualizacao\" com\ntil e cedilha. Num site PT-BR esse e o caso comum, nao o raro: ninguem\ndigita acento em caixa de busca. Normaliza query e campos com NFD.\n\nBusca vazia mostrava pagina vazia. Agora lista os 12 posts e 8\nprojetos, e a pagina vira indice navegavel do que existe no site.\n\nResultado de post ganha miniatura da capa — as capas foram criadas\nnesta mesma sessao e a busca e anterior a elas, entao projeto tinha\nimagem e post nao.\n\nRanking por onde casou: titulo > tag > descricao. Antes a ordem era a\ndo array, entao match no meio de uma descricao podia vir antes de match\nexato no titulo.\n\nQuery na URL com ?q=, debounce de 250ms e replace em vez de push —\npush empilharia uma entrada de historico por tecla digitada. Exige\nSuspense em volta por causa do useSearchParams.\n\nIdentidade editorial no cabecalho, tokens no lugar dos aliases do\nshadcn, fora as sombras e o group-hover:text-primary, que virou no-op\nquando --primary passou a resolver para fg.\n\nCorrige junto a ficha de logo do modal de projeto, que ainda era a\nescura: a arte preta do Chattie sumia dentro do modal — o lugar onde o\nvisitante foi justamente para olhar o projeto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ec26bab0b85d2c955feac3a568064b9bfd94c7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/6ec26bab0b85d2c955feac3a568064b9bfd94c7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/03ffce73715396e2ea9835cdd0efa310bedc8ff3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/03ffce73715396e2ea9835cdd0efa310bedc8ff3","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDAzZmZjZTczNzE1Mzk2ZTJlYTk4MzVjZGQwZWZhMzEwYmVkYzhmZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd","sha":"0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd"}],"sha":"03ffce73715396e2ea9835cdd0efa310bedc8ff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/03ffce73715396e2ea9835cdd0efa310bedc8ff3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:28:15Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:28:15Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(projetos): adiciona Keep, preenche papeis e corrige o logo do Vox\n\nKeep entra como oitavo projeto, primeiro na lista — mesma ordem do\nwork.tsx do aguiarlabs. Descricao escrita a partir do que o usekeep.dev\ndeclara: prioriza alerta por receita em risco em vez de severidade da\nqueda, entrega no Slack em vez de dashboard, e acompanha tres sinais de\nchurn. Categoria nova \"Revenue Ops\", que e como o proprio aguiarlabs o\nclassifica e nao cabia em nenhuma das cinco existentes.\n\nPapeis informados pelo Vinicius: FastSeller, X-Drop e Vox Pet como\nSenior Software Engineer; MovePro como projeto proprio. O papel que eu\ntinha posto no X-Drop vinha do case do aguiarlabs e descrevia escopo\n(\"construcao do zero\"), nao cargo — substituido pelo titulo real. So o\ntermAI segue sem papel.\n\nLogo do Vox Pet trocado pelo do aguiarlabs. O anterior era um wordmark\nde 5292x1404 (proporcao 3,8:1) que, espremido numa ficha quadrada de\n44px, virava uma tira de 11px de altura — era por isso que aparecia\ncomo borrao. O novo e um icone quadrado de 512px e 2,4 KB contra 172 KB.\n\nA pagina de detalhe do Vox ainda apontava para o PNG removido e teria\nsubido com imagem quebrada: nem build nem testes pegam isso, porque\nnext/image com caminho inexistente falha em runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcee97e7d655f9b1103dad27e31d19d88d7a567c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/dcee97e7d655f9b1103dad27e31d19d88d7a567c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDBkMjE3NGI5YTRlZGU2MDhlM2JiMzI0ZmJmODRlYjg4ZDFmNzZhY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38","sha":"b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38"}],"sha":"0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/0d2174b9a4ede608e3bb324fbf84eb88d1f76acd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:19:14Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:19:14Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(projetos): logos legiveis em ficha clara, em cor cheia\n\nO grayscale era ideia minha e priorizava coerencia sobre legibilidade:\nna ficha bg-surface as marcas sumiam. A causa nao era so o grayscale —\nos sete logos sao PNG transparente com luminancia muito diferente entre\nsi, e a arte do Chattie e preto solido, que desaparece sobre #0A0A0A\ncolorida ou nao.\n\nEntra --color-plate (#F2F2F2), token invariante nos dois temas, para a\nficha de logo. Token em vez de bg-white porque white chapado e\nexatamente o que o guard de paleta proibe, e com razao. A declaracao\ncarrega o comentario explicando que marca de terceiro nunca pertenceu a\npaleta do site, entao nao e excecao ao croma zero.\n\nSai o grayscale e o opacity-80: a cor volta cheia, que era o pedido.\n\nA foto do perfil na sidebar continua em grayscale — ela nao e marca de\nterceiro, e o fundo laranja do original segue sendo o unico ponto de\ncor que a identidade nao quer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7586d8b246b7fb4c627e7d730cf37c39c9608547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/7586d8b246b7fb4c627e7d730cf37c39c9608547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGI1N2YxYmI5MjhmZmViZmI4ZjgxNDY0M2ViNmYzNTA5YTM0YmZiMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979","sha":"445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979"}],"sha":"b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/b57f1bb928ffebfb8f814643eb6f3509a34bfb38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:19:02Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:19:02Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(sidebar): identidade editorial e estado ativo na navegacao\n\nA sidebar era o unico elemento que nao tinha recebido a identidade:\ncentralizada e sem um filete, ao lado de um site inteiro alinhado a\nesquerda e estruturado por hairlines — e ela aparece em todas as\npaginas, entao e o que o visitante mais ve.\n\nAlinha tudo a esquerda, separa perfil / navegacao / social por dois\nfiletes, e ancora o social no rodape com mt-auto, porque a trilha tem\naltura de tela e o conteudo ocupava so a metade de cima.\n\n\"Aguiar Labs\" parou de flutuar: estava a 22px do cargo, sem rotulo e\nsem filete, entao tipograficamente nao pertencia a nada. Agora e mono\nuppercase colado no bloco de identidade.\n\nSidebarNavLink ganha estado ativo — antes ele so fechava o drawer no\nmobile, e num site de 6 rotas a sidebar nunca dizia em que pagina voce\nestava. A home exige igualdade exata porque comparacao por prefixo a\nmarcaria ativa em toda rota do locale; as outras aceitam prefixo, que e\no que mantem /pt/projetos/x-drop acendendo \"Projetos\". O filete existe\ntransparente no estado inativo para o item nao saltar 1px ao ativar.\n\nTipografia menor: nome 28->26px, cargo 17->14px, links 17->15px.\nNavegacao secundaria nao precisa competir com o conteudo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82a18a62d69a989d9e9f73a8f854eadca08017e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/82a18a62d69a989d9e9f73a8f854eadca08017e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDQ0NWFlNDQ1OWQ5YWU0OWQwMThkMjhhMzM4ZTdmZDM2ODkxY2Q5Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8","sha":"ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8"}],"sha":"445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/445ae4459d9ae49d018d28a338e7fd36891cd979"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:08:35Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:08:35Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(projetos): restaura o FastSeller e refaz os espacamentos\n\nReverte a remocao do FastSeller: entrada, logo e a mencao no llms.txt\nvoltam, na posicao original entre o termAI e o X-Drop. Ele segue sem\npapel, stack e numero — a lacuna de dados continua, so nao justifica\nmais tirar o projeto da lista.\n\nEspacamento entre cards: a grade de 2 colunas virou columns CSS. Numa\ngrade a altura da linha e a do card mais alto, entao um projeto sem\npapel/metrica/stack abria um buraco visivel ao lado de um que tem tudo\n— o que ia piorar conforme mais projetos com poucos dados entrassem.\nCom columns os cards empacotam e o vazio some, sem esticar card curto\nnem reservar espaco morto dentro dele. A leitura passa a ser coluna a\ncoluna.\n\nRitmo interno do card: estava em quatro medidas diferentes (mt-1.5,\nmt-3.5, mt-3, mt-3) e passa a um passo unico de 16px entre blocos, com\no respiro em volta do destaque subindo para 16px nos dois lados para\nele funcionar como separador.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7507c3ec32d925174070d962e92ff145811e71ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/7507c3ec32d925174070d962e92ff145811e71ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGZmODI5NjA3MDkxZmRjZjU3ZmQ5ZGFjNWM2YWJkNTEzNDYzNWE1Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4","sha":"aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4"}],"sha":"ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/ff829607091fdcf57fd9dac5c6abd5134635a5b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:56:31Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:56:31Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(projetos): remove o FastSeller\n\nEra o card mais vazio dos sete: sem papel, sem stack e sem numero, e o\nunico projeto que nem o aguiarlabs.com.br menciona — entao nao havia de\nonde completar. Sai a entrada de data/projects.ts, o logo orfao em\npublic/images/ e a mencao no llms.txt, que passa de 7 para 6 projetos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a171cdc7ccd72cab20801e82e2d283c0c25c0a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/a171cdc7ccd72cab20801e82e2d283c0c25c0a25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGFhYjhjNTY3N2QyMmZmMTNmODQzZWVlOWMzODgxNWVhYTNiNjkzYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/771b148c4c6276927fdf69dacc8442701c7a2ab6","sha":"771b148c4c6276927fdf69dacc8442701c7a2ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/771b148c4c6276927fdf69dacc8442701c7a2ab6"}],"sha":"aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/aab8c5677d22ff13f843eee9c38815eaa3b693b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/771b148c4c6276927fdf69dacc8442701c7a2ab6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:53:51Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:53:51Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(projetos): card denso com papel, resultado e stack\n\nO Project ganha quatro campos opcionais — role, period, highlight e\nstack — e o card passa a mostra-los. A informacao boa ja existia,\nenterrada na prosa do description, que so aparecia depois de clicar no\nmodal; agora ela esta na grade.\n\nstack e string[] invariante e fica fora do guard de i18n: nome de\ntecnologia nao se traduz, e como LocalizedString exigiria cinco\ntraducoes de \"React\" por projeto. role e highlight sao LocalizedString\ncompletos nos cinco locales.\n\nOs campos sao opcionais e a grade usa items-start: projeto sem dado\nencolhe em vez de exibir espaco reservado, e a altura do card vira\nsinal de quanta substancia esta registrada. Quatro dos sete ainda nao\ntem papel nem stack.\n\nDados preenchidos vem do que ja estava publicado — a prosa deste\narquivo e os cases do aguiarlabs. Nada inferido. Chattie corrigido de\n100+ para 165+ empresas, que e o numero atual no site irmao.\n\nRestyle junto: tipografia editorial no titulo com eyebrow numerado,\nlogos em grayscale com cor no hover (resolve os tiles brancos brigando\ncom o canvas), hover por borda no lugar de sombra invisivel no escuro,\ntokens diretos no lugar dos aliases do shadcn, e o tagline deixa de ser\ntruncado por line-clamp-1.\n\nSai a barra de estatisticas: \"SaaS + E-commerce\" e \"Web + Mobile\" eram\ncategorias fantasiadas de metrica, e \"7 Projetos\" o usuario conta.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e86a4936bd7da746bc3a8291c4a1c9c8b840b35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/2e86a4936bd7da746bc3a8291c4a1c9c8b840b35"},"url"