llowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d232afa2b9ce8a5bf4c05510f561a316f03785f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:53:38Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:53:38Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(site): Senior Product Engineer, home sem hero e perfil novo\n\nTitulo do site passa de \"Frontend Engineer\" para \"Senior Product\nEngineer\" em 7 arquivos, incluindo o jobTitle do JSON-LD, as 5\ntraducoes e o llms.txt. Em japones: シニアプロダクトエンジニア.\nO cargo oficial em data/experiences.ts continua \"Product Engineer\n(Frontend)\" — e vinculo com a empresa, nao titulo de marca.\n\nA secao 01 da home sai inteira: a sidebar ja mostra nome e cargo, e\nrepetir os dois no topo da coluna era a redundancia mais visivel da\npagina. As secoes seguintes viram 01 e 02. Fica um h1 sr-only com o\nnome, porque sem ele os h2 das secoes ficariam pendurados em nada e a\nhome nao teria heading de primeiro nivel.\n\nSidebar: empresa passa a ser Aguiar Labs, a linha que repetia o cargo\nvira so o nome da empresa, o link de curriculo fica comentado com nota\nde como reverter, e a foto passa a ser a mesma de autor do aguiarlabs —\nem grayscale com cor no hover, porque o original tem fundo laranja\nsaturado que seria o unico ponto de cor de um site em croma zero.\n\nEste arquivo tambem passa a renderizar as capas de post do commit\nanterior, e o chip da tag ganha a imagem que o backdrop-blur dele nunca\nteve para desfocar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e3dfd54fd82d1ef5629a57b690f19cd027a6ffe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/9e3dfd54fd82d1ef5629a57b690f19cd027a6ffe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/d232afa2b9ce8a5bf4c05510f561a316f03785f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/d232afa2b9ce8a5bf4c05510f561a316f03785f9","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGQyMzJhZmEyYjljZThhNWJmNGMwNTUxMGY1NjFhMzE2ZjAzNzg1Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43","sha":"d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43"}],"sha":"d232afa2b9ce8a5bf4c05510f561a316f03785f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d232afa2b9ce8a5bf4c05510f561a316f03785f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:53:24Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:53:24Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(blog): capas geradas para os 12 posts, com pipeline\n\nPorta o blog-cover.ts do aguiarlabs adaptado ao modelo JSON deste repo:\ngera 3 candidatas por post com gpt-image-2, e --pick promove a escolhida\npara public/blog/<slug>/{cover.webp,og.jpg}. Nunca roda no build.\n\nlib/blog/cover-styles.ts e irmao do arquivo de mesmo nome no aguiarlabs\ne deve ser mantido em sincronia: o estilo render3d e as constraints de\n\"sem texto, sem cor\" sao o que faz as capas dos dois sites parecerem a\nmesma marca. A imagem nunca carrega texto porque uma capa serve os 5\nlocales.\n\nlib/posts.ts deriva `cover` da existencia do arquivo em disco em vez de\num campo no JSON — o loader ja le do disco, entao um flag manual so\npoderia divergir dele.\n\nCorrige de quebra 11 dos 12 posts que compartilhavam o /og-image.png\ngenerico: cada um passa a ter card social proprio. Um ogImage declarado\na mao continua ganhando da capa gerada, para nao atropelar arte manual.\n\nAs 12 capas somam 776 KB. A renderizacao no card da home vai no commit\nseguinte, junto das outras mudancas daquele arquivo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec0f8b713541a6eeedc07b4e814ed11f6cb2573a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/ec0f8b713541a6eeedc07b4e814ed11f6cb2573a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGQ0MjhiNGQxNDA1MjFiYzhiNTk4ZWExM2JjZTM5Y2U3MjdmMTFiNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1","sha":"14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1"}],"sha":"d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d428b4d140521bc8b598ea13bce39ce727f11b43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:03:58Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:03:58Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"docs(spec): apendice com as seis afirmacoes falsas da spec\n\nA spec foi escrita antes da implementacao e errou em seis pontos, todos\ndescobertos pela execucao ou pela revisao de branch completa e ja\ncorrigidos no codigo.\n\nO mais grave: o diagnostico da hairline da sidebar direita sustentava\numa conclusao falsa. A declaracao hsl(oklch(...)) e invalida, mas nao e\npor isso que a hairline sumia — right-sidebar.tsx passa collapsible=none\ne o shadcn faz early return sem data-side, entao as dez regras\n[data-side=\"right\"] nunca casaram. Corrigir o valor nao produzia o\nresultado prometido.\n\nCausa raiz das tres afirmacoes falsas: derivadas de ler um arquivo\nisolado em vez de seguir o caminho de renderizacao. grep diz o que esta\nescrito, nao o que e aplicado.\n\nRegistra tambem a tensao nao resolvida entre o Objetivo (componente\ncopiavel entre os repos) e o mecanismo aprovado (camada de compat que\nmantem ~293 usos do vocabulario shadcn).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54e0a01348eda1727d39fc563cccfab5926feee2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/54e0a01348eda1727d39fc563cccfab5926feee2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDE0MTM1NjM2ZDc5Nzk4NzY2OTdlNmVkYjdjYjkxNzlhYThhMzg2ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e","sha":"06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e"}],"sha":"14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/14135636d7979876697e6edb7cb9179aa8a386f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:58:53Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:58:53Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(design): endereça achados da revisão de branch completa\n\nCorrige nove achados de uma revisão que olhou o branch inteiro após as seis\ntasks já commitadas e revisadas individualmente:\n\n- Sidebar direita não tinha hairline: collapsible=\"none\" cai no early-return\n  de components/ui/sidebar.tsx, que nunca seta data-side nem data-slot\n  sidebar-inner — as dez regras [data-side=\"right\"] em globals.css eram\n  mortas por atributo ausente, não por valor inválido. Hairline agora via\n  border-l border-line direto no componente; as dez regras mortas, removidas.\n- Dois hovers eram no-ops (--muted e --sidebar resolvem para a mesma cor):\n  search-button e o ícone Home da sidebar direita migram para o idioma de\n  contraste de valor (text-mu hover:text-fg) já usado no resto da identidade.\n- Chip mono canônico extraído para MONO_CHIP em lib/utils.ts e aplicado nos\n  sete sites que renderizavam categoria/tag, incluindo um que não era chip\n  nenhum (bg-muted sólido, sem borda, sem mono). Composição via cn()/\n  tailwind-merge verificada com script Node contra a lib instalada.\n- Links inline em posts (lib/inline-md.tsx) só sublinhavam no hover — e\n  text-primary agora resolve para --color-fg, mesma cor do corpo do texto.\n  Sublinhado passa a ser o estado de repouso.\n- Toggle de tema: a troca Sun/Moon feita na Task 2 invertia o significado do\n  indicador sem motivo — o script de bloqueio do next-themes já seta\n  data-theme antes do primeiro paint, então o estado base nunca era\n  observado nem antes nem depois da troca. Revertido à convenção original.\n- --radius: 0 e as quatro escalas derivadas foram removidas do CSS supondo\n  que \"0 usos fora de rounded-full\" era permanente. Tailwind v4 faz merge\n  de @theme com o tema padrão em vez de substituí-lo — removido o override,\n  --radius-md volta a 0.375rem, e o guard de cantos não vigia components/ui/.\n  Restauradas as cinco declarações com comentário explicando o motivo real.\n- Guard de cantos sinalizava rounded-none como falso positivo; regex ganha\n  (?!-none) ao lado do (?!-full) já existente.\n- <pre> em code-block.tsx mesclava className duas vezes (wrapper e <pre>);\n  inofensivo hoje (nenhum call site passa className), removido da duplicata.\n- --syntax-4 no tema claro (0.828 0.189 84.429) mede ~1.51:1 contra\n  --color-card — e já excede o gamut sRGB nesse L, o navegador recorta para\n  ~#FABC00. Novo valor oklch(0.5 0.1 84.429), mesmo matiz, mede 5.31:1\n  (WCAG AA), calculado com conversão OKLCH → sRGB linear própria. Só o tema\n  claro foi tocado.\n\npnpm test (30/30), typecheck, lint, build (110 páginas) e aeo (100/100)\nverificados após as mudanças. Detalhes e comandos literais em\n.superpowers/sdd/2026-09-20-identidade-visual-aguiarlabs/fix-wave-report.md.\n\nInclui também correções de documentação já pendentes na árvore de trabalho\n(plan/spec: --chart-* foi renomeado para --syntax-*, não deletado).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75e96bf14fd8184c2bbc510689a8bd05a8d623ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/75e96bf14fd8184c2bbc510689a8bd05a8d623ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDA2ZDc3ODYwM2QzNmE0YTU0MDliNGUzNWNhZjZmZDk4N2FhMDVhMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/840b46c387714f827a5f29d8220df800ae4d5a9e","sha":"840b46c387714f827a5f29d8220df800ae4d5a9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/840b46c387714f827a5f29d8220df800ae4d5a9e"}],"sha":"06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/06d778603d36a4a5409b4e35caf6fd987aa05a2e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/840b46c387714f827a5f29d8220df800ae4d5a9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:27:07Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:27:07Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(design): guard de croma/cantos passa a varrer lib/, code inline via classe unica\n\nlib/inline-md.tsx renderiza JSX com Tailwind mas ficava fora do\nSCAN_DIRS do guard (app, components), entao seu rounded sobreviveu a\nquatro tasks de varredura. SCAN_DIRS agora inclui lib/.\n\nrenderInlineCode troca \"rounded border border-border bg-muted/60\" pelos\ntokens da paleta (border-line, bg-card), perde o canto e ganha font-mono\n— vira a unica fonte de estilo do code inline. A regra \":not(pre) > code\"\nadicionada em globals.css na Task 6 sai: era redundante e perdia para\nessa classe na especificidade do CSS, entao nunca chegava a renderizar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"325f486ee2fb019726432e438786ef5320b152b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusag