gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/24990456ba2f53afb68382951018a53c6d28a1a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:11:05Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:11:05Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(design): section 03 vira <section>, ganha h2 sr-only\n\nO layout ja renderiza um <main> em volta do conteudo da pagina; o bloco\nde posts tambem era um <main>, o que aninhava dois na mesma arvore —\ninvalido pelo spec e confuso para leitores de tela e crawlers. Vira\n<section>, estruturalmente igual a secao 02.\n\nA secao nao tem titulo visivel, entao os titulos dos posts ficavam\npendurados no heading da secao anterior. Adiciona um h2 sr-only com o\nmesmo texto do eyebrow (Escrita/Writing/Escritura/Escritura JP/FR), sem\ninventar copy nova — mesmo padrao usado no aguiarlabs para secoes sem\ntitulo visivel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71856a7baacf38ff077482ea51f63ac535be6e36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/71856a7baacf38ff077482ea51f63ac535be6e36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/24990456ba2f53afb68382951018a53c6d28a1a1","verification":{"payload":null,"r