"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/580b6a53fcb68591192c59307352689ec724bcc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:07:45Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:07:45Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(design): assinatura editorial na home\n\nEyebrow mono numerado com filete abrindo cada secao, headline display\nem clamp(2.25rem,5.2vw,4.5rem) com leading 0.94, CTA primario invertido\ncom seta que desliza, e rise-in escalonado no hero.\n\nA escala e recalibrada para a coluna de 1024px: o clamp do aguiarlabs\npressupoe grid full-bleed de 1400px e empurraria os CTAs para fora da\nprimeira dobra.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"63447974cb99ac711354fb5162e6053b75099dc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/63447974cb99ac711354fb5162e6053b75099dc8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/580b6a53fcb68591192c59307352689ec724bcc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events