uiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/93dc2c197f529b232470da2eae7afdbab4ec8bb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:53:17Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:53:36Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(design): cantos retos, com guard que os mantem\n\nRemove as 121 ocorrencias de rounded em caixas e as quatro escalas de\nradius. rounded-full continua permitido e em uso na foto de perfil e\nnos indicadores, que sao formas redondas por natureza.\n\nO guard nao vigia components/ui/: com --radius 0 as classes de la ja\nresolvem para 0, e vigia-las quebraria o CI no proximo shadcn add.\n\nEndurece tambem o guard de paleta (Task 3): border direcional\n(border-t-, border-r-, etc.) e ring-offset- agora sao capturados, e o\nregex de valores arbitrarios passa a reconhecer rgb/rgba/hsl/hsla/\noklch/lab, nao so hex. Zero ocorrencias hoje, guard so fica mais\nrigoroso. Normaliza py-0.5 para py-1 nos quatro chips mono que\nrestaram divergentes, e equaliza o badge \"escolhido\" da pagina de\nengenharia com border-transparent para nao encolher 2px em relacao ao\nbadge nao escolhido.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"76f0b4f2605a35050e3a3ac3aafa7f1c960355df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/76f0b4f2605a35050e3a3ac3aafa7f1c960355df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/93dc2c197f529b232470da2eae7afdbab4ec8bb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/93dc2c197f529b232470da2eae7afdbab4ec8bb2","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDkzZGMyYzE5N2Y1MjliMjMyNDcwZGEyZWFlN2FmZGJhYjRlYzhiYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/1e09c7cfa3bfb3b6d888b50027c0729ed57a426e","sha":"1e09c7cfa3bfb3b6d888b50027c0729ed57a426e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/1e09c7cfa3bfb3b6d888b50027c0729ed57a426e"}],"sha":"93dc2c197f529b232470da2eae7afdbab4ec8bb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/93dc2c197f529b232470da2eae7afdbab4ec8bb2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/p