/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/4b32d5ffd7a4c38e375fe71e842bc1725ed01f94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:15:44Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:15:44Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(design): restaura foco visível e paleta de sintaxe do Prism\n\nAdiciona o bloco *:focus-visible que foi omitido na implementação anterior,\nrestaurando o indicador de foco WCAG 2.4.7. Renomeia os tokens de sintaxe\nde --chart-* para --syntax-* (oklch values originais preservados) e atualiza\nas seis referencias no bloco Prism.js correspondente. A sintaxe é a excessao\ndeliberada ao croma zero da identidade visual: o grayscale vale para a\nmoldura do bloco de codigo, nao para os tokens da linguagem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93a85d233145264eb49faf55d9237be73dbe0027","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/93a85d233145264eb49faf55d9237be73dbe0027"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/4b32d5ffd7a4c38e375fe71e842bc1725ed01f94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https