_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/36115d8a34fa86305a4696dac679f9389a1c8f6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:07:39Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:07:39Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"feat(design): adota os 7 tokens do aguiarlabs como fonte da verdade\n\nOs tokens do shadcn viram aliases que apontam para canvas/surface/card/\nline/field/fg/mu, entao components/ui/ segue funcionando sem reescrita.\n--accent e --sidebar-accent ficam um degrau acima do fundo em que se\napoiam, senao o hover some; --ring aponta para fg porque um anel em\n#1C1C1C mede 1.20:1 e reprova no WCAG 1.4.11.\n\nCorrige tambem hsl(var(--sidebar-border)) com valor oklch dentro:\ndeclaracao invalida que impedia a hairline da sidebar direita de\nrenderizar. Deleta --chart-1..5 (10 declaracoes, 0 usos).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48c382982e8e066dbb2a7bc914d01999b2fe8eb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/48c382982e8e066dbb2a7bc914d01999b2fe8eb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/36115d8a34fa86305a4696dac679f9389a1c8f6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12