ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/9161cc93cf67fb26db0c451322b44ae8818bd15f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T15:47:56Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:03:16Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"docs(spec): emenda a purga de cor com os 47 pontos que faltavam\n\nO levantamento original contou 85 classes cromaticas. O completo achou\n132 pontos: somam-se as familias neutras do Tailwind, white/black\nchapados, tres hex arbitrarios e o campo tagColor, que vive nos 12\nJSONs de post e nenhuma varredura de .tsx enxerga.\n\nRegistra tambem a excecao sancionada do scrim (bg-black com opacidade,\ncomo o proprio aguiarlabs usa) e os dois guards em lib/design-system.test.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9224d03a141330e0d8019617f530de4f623229a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/e9224d03a141330e0d8019617f530de4f623229a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/9161cc93cf67fb26db0c451322b44ae8818bd15f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAgui