"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/6e63557b598a4c3001e787dd555cf9253cfebc4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:48:07Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:48:07Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"docs(CLAUDE.md): Corrigir mecanismos de validacao na receita de locale\n\nFix 1: Site 4 (data/experiences.test.ts) nao eh Record<Locale, ...>; eh validado via strict mode em tsconfig (TS7053), nao via propriedade obrigatoria.\n\nFix 2: README.md e public/llms.txt tem listas de locales em prosa nao guardadas por nada (tsc, lib/i18n-coverage.test.ts, scripts/aeo-check.ts).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a76acd6ddaa5f0456ac767c7f0e581143f228135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/a76acd6ddaa5f0456ac767c7f0e581143f228135"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/6e63557b598a4c3001e787dd555cf9253cfebc4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/6e63557b598a4c3001e787dd555cf9253cfebc4f","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDZlNjM1NTdiNTk4YTRjMzAwMWU3ODdkZDU1NWNmOTI1M2NmZWJjNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071","sha":"d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071"}],"sha":"6e63557b598a4c3001e787dd555cf9253cfebc4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/6e63557b598a4c3001e787dd555cf9253cfebc4f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:30:42Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:30:42Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"docs: receita de novo locale lista os quatro sites manuais reais\n\nA frase anterior dizia que bastava LOCALES + os mapas HTML_LANGS/\nOG_LOCALES e que \"todo o resto deriva de LOCALES\". A parte enumerada\n(proxy, sitemap, hreflang, generateStaticParams) e verdadeira e foi\nconferida, mas \"todo o resto\" nao era: language-toggle, getDictionary e\no mapa contractWord do teste de experiences continuam manuais.\n\nVerificado empiricamente em vez de assumido: adicionei um sexto locale\n\"de\" aplicando apenas o passo 1 da receita e registrei o que quebra. O\ntsc acusou components/language-toggle.tsx (flags e labels),\ndata/experiences.test.ts (contractWord) e todo Localized de\ndata/experiences.ts; o guard acusou o fallback de getDictionary, 294\nobjetos incompletos e 66 campos de post faltando. Nada alem disso.\nO experimento foi revertido.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf25e1cfcd4ba977cdf3d82847aa8309717a9ed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/cf25e1cfcd4ba977cdf3d82847aa8309717a9ed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKGQyNTdhZTIyNDdiZjE4ZjM5ZGRjOTJmNThlY2YxNGEyMjU2MTcwNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/7f028338cf178fb24129857affca74b4873aebdd","sha":"7f028338cf178fb24129857affca74b4873aebdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/7f028338cf178fb24129857affca74b4873aebdd"}],"sha":"d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/d257ae2247bf18f39ddc92f58ecf14a225617071"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/7f028338cf178fb24129857affca74b4873aebdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:24:46Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:24:46Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"fix(i18n): normaliza sigle API como invariavel no plural em frances\n\nO corpus frances nascia dividido: tarefas iniciais escreviam \"des APIs\",\ntarefas finais escreviam \"des API\". Como nao havia frances no merge-base,\nnao e legado contra novo -- e o corpus discordando de si mesmo.\n\nO frances trata sigles como invariaveis (\"des URL\", \"des PME\"), o brief\nprescrevia essa forma, e e o mesmo raciocinio que ja tinha derrubado\n\"REST API\" em favor de \"API REST\" neste projeto.\n\nSete ocorrencias francesas normalizadas; os adjetivos seguem no plural\n(\"des API tierces\", \"des API externes\"), porque a sigle e invariavel em\nforma mas continua plural em numero. Censo frances: 7 -> 0 ocorrencias\nde \"APIs\". Valores pt/en/es/jp intactos, onde \"APIs\" e correto na lingua.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bbcafc1bf41a3e8acbac1e3a06b729ce2c9f3ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/5bbcafc1bf41a3e8acbac1e3a06b729ce2c9f3ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/7f028338cf178fb24129857affca74b4873aebdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url