1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/975517e20e550aa2948cc8bfd129e3470092feec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:20:16Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:20:16Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"refactor(i18n): Localized deriva de Locale em vez de enumerar locales\n\nO type era escrito a mao com os cinco locales, o que obriga uma edicao\nmanual a cada locale novo. Record<Locale, string> e substituto direto\ncom a mesma exigencia do tsc: removendo a chave `fr` de um Localized,\no compilador ainda acusa \"Property ''fr'' is missing ... but required in\ntype ''Localized''\".\n\nMesma classe de drift que data/experiences.test.ts eliminou uma linha\nadiante ao apagar seu proprio const LOCALES hardcoded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d3556be091c0907064543e79930c8d13dec025a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/4d3556be091c0907064543e79930c8d13dec025a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/commits/975517e20e550aa2948cc8bfd129e3470092feec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/975517e20e550aa2948cc8bfd129e3470092feec","node_id":"C_kwDOQAqRctoAKDk3NTUxN2UyMGU1NTBhYTI5NDhjYzhiZmQxMjllMzQ3MDA5MmZlZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commit/7811f2d191c18a4841a5680a2de9d4a0c014064f","sha":"7811f2d191c18a4841a5680a2de9d4a0c014064f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/7811f2d191c18a4841a5680a2de9d4a0c014064f"}],"sha":"975517e20e550aa2948cc8bfd129e3470092feec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/975517e20e550aa2948cc8bfd129e3470092feec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120150632?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniAguiar1","id":120150632,"login":"ViniAguiar1","node_id":"U_kgDOBylaaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniAguiar1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/commits/7811f2d191c18a4841a5680a2de9d4a0c014064f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:18:41Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:18:41Z","email":"vinicius.aguiar1@icloud.com","name":"ViniAguiar1"},"message":"refactor(i18n): FAQ de engenharia vira array unico de chamadas t()\n\nA cadeia de ternarios de cinco ramos era invisivel para o guard de\ncobertura: os objetos { q, a } dentro dos arrays nao tem chave `pt`,\nentao lib/i18n-coverage.test.ts nunca os inspecionava. O tsc tambem nao\najudava, porque um ternario com else final e exaustivo por construcao.\nUm sexto locale renderizaria o FAQ em portugues, incluindo o JSON-LD\nFAQPage, sob um <html lang> nao portugues.\n\nMesma classe de defeito ja corrigida em components/projects-grid.tsx e\nem app/[locale]/projetos/x-drop/page.tsx no commit 8030eb2; esta era a\nmaior instancia restante.\n\nAs 50 strings foram movidas verbatim, geradas a partir do array antigo\navaliado por locale -- o snapshot do FAQ tem SHA-256 identico antes e\ndepois nos cinco locales, com as cinco perguntas na mesma ordem. Os dez\nnovos objetos passam a ser visiveis ao guard, que segue em zero.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64e86687a78305d64f07df201bab1bc3ec4803b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniAguiar1/viniciusaguiardev/git/trees/64e86687a78305d64f07df201bab1bc3ec