e-brand808/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-brand808/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-brand808/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-brand808","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GNGscr/journey-app/commits/547d4c2d0c138d4800c28929e98c1c6aa59a0f70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-17T17:11:46Z","email":"de.brand808@gmail.com","name":"GNGscr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-17T17:11:46Z","email":"de.brand808@gmail.com","name":"GNGscr"},"message":"refactor(project-structure): reorganize folders into clear, modular architecture\n\n1. Moved main layout (JourneyApp) into layouts/ for cleaner separation of app shell.\n2. Split components into domain-based folders:\n  - pages/ for top-level screens (LandingPage, SummaryPage)\n  - steps/ for step-by-step flow logic (ChoiceStep, JourneySteps)\n  - ui/ for reusable visual components (Loader, Confetti, ProgressIndicator)\n3. Added services/ - layer for data handling and API abstraction (journey.ts)\n4. Grouped enums, types, and variants under constants/ for centralized definitions.\n5. Improved project scalability and clarity by separating logic, UI, and data layers.","tree":{"sha":"a66d8e2b6f1d7e626701eef6e05f941f09f855b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GNGscr/journey-app/git/trees/a66d8e2b6f1d7e626701eef6e05f941f09f855b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GNGscr/journey-app/git/commits/547d4c2d0c138d4800c28929e98c1c6aa59a0f70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180703382?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-brand808/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-brand808/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/de-brand808/following{/other_user}","gists_url":